he New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/47221ab1-be3d-590e-9b82-9e97d60db3a0', 'word_count': 3778, 'uri': 'nyt://article/47221ab1-be3d-590e-9b82-9e97d60db3a0'}, {'abstract': 'Don’t rush the inquiry, and make it about more than Trump’s Ukraine scandal.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/09/30/opinion/republicans-impeachment-inquiry.html', 'snippet': 'Don’t rush the inquiry, and make it about more than Trump’s Ukraine scandal.', 'lead_paragraph': 'House Democratic leaders, following frustrated efforts to hold President Trump to account, understandably want to strike quickly to impeach him on the grounds of one extremely serious issue: his pressuring the president of Ukraine to get the goods on his Democratic rival Joe Biden. But they’re risking making their target too narrow and moving too fast.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/09/30/opinion/30drew1/merlin_161537106_c22dc603-10bd-4553-927a-d4582a67bb2a-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/09/30/opinion/30drew1/merlin_161537106_c22dc603-10bd-4553-927a-d4582a67bb2a-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/09/30/opinion/30drew1/merlin_161537106_c22dc603-10bd-4553-927a-d4582a67bb2a-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/09/30/opinion/30drew1/merlin_161537106_c22dc603-10bd-4553-927a-d4582a67bb2a-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'capt