-common-shopping.html', 'snippet': 'Isn’t “premium outlet” an oxymoron? A trip to the 250 stores of Woodbury Common suggests it’s not.', 'lead_paragraph': 'They come by car and park in color-coded garages set along the perimeter of a cluster-model mall — stores arranged in Stepford neighborhood groupings: Niagara, Hudson Valley, Saratoga. The shops face inward around a series of walkways leading to open-air commons, framed by the pastoral backdrop of low wooded hills. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/02/fashion/01CRITIC-WOODBURY-6/merlin_161335785_55b95971-689b-4c5a-8cd1-3d77730d8bd8-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/02/fashion/01CRITIC-WOODBURY-6/merlin_161335785_55b95971-689b-4c5a-8cd1-3d77730d8bd8-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/02/fashion/01CRITIC-WOODBURY-6/merlin_161335785_55b95971-689b-4c5a-8cd1-3d77730d8bd8-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/02/fashion/01CRITIC-WOODBURY-6/merlin_161335785_55b95971-689b-4c5a-8cd1-3d77730d8bd8-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/02/fashion/01CRITIC-WOODBURY-6/01CRITIC-WOODBURY-6-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/10/02/fashion/01CRITIC-WOODBURY-6/01CRITIC-WOODBURY-6-thumbStan