web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/01/us/politics/white-house-classified-computer-system.html', 'snippet': 'A whistle-blower said advisers improperly restricted access to a record of President Trump’s Ukraine call. Here is how that storage system works.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The whistle-blower who revealed President Trump’s attempt to pressure Ukraine’s leader to open investigations that could benefit him politically also accused White House officials of essentially hiding a rough record of the conversation by placing it in the same highly restricted computer system for closely guarded government secrets.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/09/30/us/politics/30dc-codeword/merlin_161752764_11e4ea2e-620f-4ed2-a4d1-a64e667c31f9-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/09/30/us/politics/30dc-codeword/merlin_161752764_11e4ea2e-620f-4ed2-a4d1-a64e667c31f9-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/09/30/us/politics/30dc-codeword/merlin_161752764_11e4ea2e-620f-4ed2-a4d1-a64e667c31f9-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/09/30/us/politics/30dc-codeword/merlin_161752764_11e4ea2e-620f-4ed2-a4d1-a64e667c31f9-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/09/30/us/politics/30dc-codeword/30dc-code-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumb