ident violated protocol.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/01/opinion/trump-ukraine.html', 'snippet': 'Almost everything about President Trump’s conversation with Ukraine’s president violated protocol.', 'lead_paragraph': 'President Trump, his Republican sycophants in Congress, and the right-wing media are working overtime yet again to distract and manipulate the American public. To downplay Mr. Trump’s transgressions, they are drawing a false equivalence between his July phone call with President Zelensky of Ukraine and former Vice President Biden’s efforts in 2015 to encourage the replacement of the Ukrainian prosecutor general.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/01/opinion/01Rice-sub/merlin_161856126_5fbf0a9a-5533-4968-914d-2f53455cd599-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/01/opinion/01Rice-sub/merlin_161856126_5fbf0a9a-5533-4968-914d-2f53455cd599-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/01/opinion/01Rice-sub/merlin_161856126_5fbf0a9a-5533-4968-914d-2f53455cd599-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/01/opinion/01Rice-sub/merlin_161856126_5fbf0a9a-5533-4968-914d-2f53455cd599-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/01/opinion/01Rice-sub/01Rice-sub-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail