9-10-01T17:26:49+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sarah Kerr and David Botti', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sarah', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kerr', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Botti', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Video', '_id': 'nyt://video/0ee77e1a-5196-52bf-866a-7006bc7781fe', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://video/0ee77e1a-5196-52bf-866a-7006bc7781fe'}, {'abstract': 'There’s little joy in this documentary, despite its title. But the movie is both revealing and beguiling.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/01/movies/celebration-review.html', 'snippet': 'There’s little joy in this documentary, despite its title. But the movie is both revealing and beguiling.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Early in this century, the documentary director Olivier Meyrou, at the invitation of Pierre Bergé, spent two and a half years filming the couturier Yves Saint Laurent and his employees and associates. Bergé, of course, was one of them: Saint Laurent’s longtime business manager, hard-nosed where Saint Laurent was dreamy, is a central figure in “Celebration,” which chronicles the creation of what would be Saint Laurent’s final collection.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/04/arts/celebration1/celebration1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/04/arts/celebration1/celebration1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/04/arts/celebration1/celebration1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/04/arts/celebration1/celebration1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1094, 'width': 1944, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/04/arts/celebration1/celebration1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/10/04/arts/celebration1/celebration1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/04/arts/celebration1/celebration1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '‘Celebration’ Review: The Final Stand of Yves Saint Laurent', 'kicker': 'Critic’s Pick', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Celebration', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Documentary Films and Programs', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Saint Laurent, Yves', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Meyrou, Olivier', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Berge, Pierre', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Celebration (Movie)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-10-01T17:54:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By Glenn Kenny', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Glenn', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kenny', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/5a662140-bf7b-5309-9b92-f8de9aa153da', 'word_count': 280, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5a662140-bf7b-5309-9b92-f8de9aa153da'}, {'abstract': 'Modern Love in miniature, featuring reader-submitted stories of no more than 100 words.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/01/style/tiny-modern-love-stories-not-a-mistake.html', 'snippet': 'Modern Love in miniature, featuring reader-submitted stories of no more than 100 words.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When my 61-year-old father learned he had Alzheimer’s, we went to CVS together and bought the largest stack of notecards they sold. I asked, “What’s the town where you grew up?” We wrote Union Springs, Ala. I asked, “Who was your first kiss?” Amanda. Four years later, preparing to move my father into memory care, I packed up his desk. Taking the notecards felt silly, so I wrapped the long-forgotten stack in a rubber band and opened his drawer to toss them away. Inside, I found more notecards. They all said the same thing: my name. I collapsed to the floor. — Drew Hasson', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/27/fashion/27ML-TINYLOVE-ILLO6/27ML-TINYLOVE-ILLO6-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/08/27/fashion/27ML-TINYLOVE-ILLO6/27ML-TINYLOVE-ILLO6-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/27/fashion/27ML-TINYLOVE-ILLO6/27ML-TINYLOVE-ILLO6-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/27/fashion/27ML-TINYLOVE-ILLO6/27ML-TINYLOVE-ILLO6-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 