t should have shared a campaign-finance investigation with the Federal Election Commission.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/02/opinion/trump-whistleblower-fec.html', 'snippet': 'The Justice Department should have shared a campaign-finance investigation with the Federal Election Commission.', 'lead_paragraph': 'One of the first things new prosecutors at the Justice Department learn is that cover-ups are rarely singular. There is often a cover-up of the cover-up.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/02/opinion/02katyal-geltzer/merlin_154237542_626a2c89-a6a6-4297-a0d7-0ab61b218326-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/02/opinion/02katyal-geltzer/merlin_154237542_626a2c89-a6a6-4297-a0d7-0ab61b218326-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/02/opinion/02katyal-geltzer/merlin_154237542_626a2c89-a6a6-4297-a0d7-0ab61b218326-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/02/opinion/02katyal-geltzer/merlin_154237542_626a2c89-a6a6-4297-a0d7-0ab61b218326-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/02/opinion/02katyal-geltzer/02katyal-geltzer-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/10/02/opinion/02katyal-geltzer/02katyal-geltzer-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'ra