1-9836-5c2e-a509-c632c1aeca1d'}, {'abstract': 'President Trump attacked two House leaders after they threatened to subpoena the White House, and Mike Pompeo, the secretary of state, confirmed he listened in on the call with Ukraine’s president.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/02/us/politics/trump-impeachment-inquiry.html', 'snippet': 'President Trump attacked two House leaders after they threatened to subpoena the White House, and Mike Pompeo, the secretary of state, confirmed he listened in on the call with Ukraine’s president.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Representative Elijah E. Cummings of Maryland, the chairman of the Oversight and Reform Committee, notified his committee of the impending subpoena on Wednesday. He said the White House had thus far ignored Congress’s voluntary requests for materials related to President Trump’s efforts to pressure Ukraine into investigating Joseph R. Biden Jr. and his son and any attempt by the administration to conceal his actions.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/02/us/politics/02dc-impeach-sub/merlin_161984469_03a8b410-7ba8-4457-823d-ad8a95d8814b-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/02/us/politics/02dc-impeach-sub/merlin_161984469_03a8b410-7ba8-4457-823d-ad8a95d8814b-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/02/us/politics/02dc-impeach-sub/merlin_161984469_03a8b410-7ba8-4457-823d-ad8a95d8814b-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/02/us/politics/02dc-impeach-sub/merlin_161984469_03a8b410-7ba8-4457-823d-ad8a95d8814b-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/02/us/politics/02dc-impeach-sub/02impeach-sub-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/10/02/us/politics/02dc-impeach-sub/02impeach-sub-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/02/us/politics/02dc-impeach-sub/02impeach-sub-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Trump Impeachment Inquiry: Latest Updates', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Impeachment', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Biden, Joseph R Jr', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'House of Representatives', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-10-02T15:57:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Washington', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/837adf0b-c881-5b0b-8598-9da3d017eef8', 'word_count': 1772, 'uri': 'nyt://article/837adf0b-c881-5b0b-8598-9da3d017eef8'}, {'abstract': 'The House should consider the president’s incendiary rhetoric as a separate offense, worthy of its own article of impeachment, as it was in 1868.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/02/opinion/andrew-johnsons-violent-language-and-trumps.html', 'snippet': 'The House should consider the president’s incendiary rhetoric as a separate offense, worthy of its own article of impeachment, as it was in 1868.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Over the weekend, in a rage over impeachment, President Trump accused Representative Adam Schiff of “treason,” promised “Big Consequences” for the whistle-blower who sounded the alarm about his phone call with President Volodymyr Zelensky of Ukraine and shared a warning — from a Baptist pastor in Dallas — that impeachment “will cause a Civil War like fracture in this Nation from which our Country will never heal.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/02/opinion/02bouieWeb/merlin_161485710_1c52e194-75b4-405c-9f2f-acd1984fc7a7-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 809, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/02/opinion/02bouieWeb/merlin_161485710_1c52e194-75b4-405c-9f2f-acd1984fc7a7-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 809}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/02/opinion/02bouieWeb/merlin_161485710_1c52e194-75b4-405c-9f2f-acd1984fc7a7-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 759, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/02/opinion/02bouieWeb/merlin_161485710_1c52e194-75b4-405c-9f2f-acd1984fc7a7-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1518, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/02/opinion/02bouieWeb/02bouieWeb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/10/02/opinion/02bouieWeb/02bouieWeb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 