_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2019-10-04T04:22:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'NYTNow', 'section_name': 'Briefing', 'byline': {'original': 'By Melina Delkic', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Melina', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Delkic', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'briefing', '_id': 'nyt://article/64ea0fc8-ac69-51a1-be1d-8f261e04942a', 'word_count': 1311, 'uri': 'nyt://article/64ea0fc8-ac69-51a1-be1d-8f261e04942a'}, {'abstract': '“The Blacklist” returns for a seventh season on NBC. And a series about a young superhero debuts on Netflix.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/04/arts/television/whats-on-tv-friday-the-blacklist-and-raising-dion.html', 'snippet': '“The Blacklist” returns for a seventh season on NBC. And a series about a young superhero debuts on Netflix.', 'lead_paragraph': 'THE BLACKLIST 8 p.m. on NBC. If you want to end your TV show’s season on a cliffhanger, having the main character get abducted isn’t a bad way to do it. That’s what happened at the end of the previous season of this popular thriller. The show stars James Spader as a criminal mastermind who goes by the name Raymond Reddington and who begins working with the F.B.I. to help them bag high-profile lawbreakers. Season 6 concluded with a former K.G.B. agent (played by Laila Robins) plunging a syringe into Reddington, watching as her associates put him into the back of a van and made off with one of Reddington’s characteristic fedoras for good measure. The seventh season kicks off Friday, and picks up from there. “There will be an episode of ‘The Blacklist’ that is just fun and another that is very intense and then another that is rather ruthless and brutal,” Spader told The New York Times last year. “I still love the element of surprise, even for myself.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/04/arts/04tvcol-blacklist/04tvcol-blacklist-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/04/arts/04tvcol-blacklist/04tvcol-blacklist-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/04/arts/04tvcol-blacklist/04tvcol-blacklist-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/04/arts/04tvcol-blacklist/04tvcol-blacklist-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/04/arts/04tvcol-blacklist/04tvcol-blacklist-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/10/04/arts/04tvcol-blacklist/04tvcol-blacklist-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/04/arts/04tvcol-blacklist/04tvcol-blacklist-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'What’s on TV Friday: ‘The Blacklist’ and ‘Raising Dion’', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'What’s On Friday', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': 