: 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1779d903-7c77-5b52-b4b8-3141543b58e6', 'word_count': 1673, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1779d903-7c77-5b52-b4b8-3141543b58e6'}, {'abstract': 'Collectives in cities around the world are bringing computer languages to the club.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/04/style/live-code-music.html', 'snippet': 'Collectives in cities around the world are bringing computer languages to the club.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On a computer, Sonic Pi looks like any other coding language. It’s a mess of numbers, parentheticals, punctuation marks and keywords, splattered over an LCD screen. But offscreen — and through a set of quality speakers — those keystrokes produce music you might dance to on a Friday night.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/06/fashion/00clubcode-1/merlin_161398722_6c45769a-7664-47a0-af32-cd4c07b3ce8a-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/06/fashion/00clubcode-1/merlin_161398722_6c45769a-7664-47a0-af32-cd4c07b3ce8a-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/06/fashion/00clubcode-1/merlin_161398722_6c45769a-7664-47a0-af32-cd4c07b3ce8a-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/06/fashion/00clubcode-1/merlin_161398722_6c45769a-7664-47a0-af32-cd4c07b3ce8a-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/06/fashion/00clubco