, {'abstract': 'Naomi Osaka beat Bianca Andreescu in Beijing on Friday in the first of what tennis fans hope will be many matches between the young stars.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/04/sports/tennis/naomi-osaka-bianca-andreescu.html', 'snippet': 'Naomi Osaka beat Bianca Andreescu in Beijing on Friday in the first of what tennis fans hope will be many matches between the young stars.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Women’s tennis has so much going for it: new stars from different continents, week-to-week suspense, and grande dame Serena Williams’s ongoing quest for a 24th major singles title.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/05/sports/04clarey1-print/merlin_162116187_60f116c5-bd33-4f81-84a0-99e43e9776fc-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/05/sports/04clarey1-print/merlin_162116187_60f116c5-bd33-4f81-84a0-99e43e9776fc-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/05/sports/04clarey1-print/merlin_162116187_60f116c5-bd33-4f81-84a0-99e43e9776fc-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/05/sports/04clarey1-print/merlin_162116187_60f116c5-bd33-4f81-84a0-99e43e9776fc-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/05/sports/04clarey1-print/04clarey-01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'l