d_paragraph': 'Derek Shelton knows midges. Twelve years ago, Shelton, now the Minnesota Twins’ bench coach, stood in Cleveland’s home dugout as the Indians’ hitting coach when the winged insects swarmed in off Lake Erie, disrupting Game 2 of an American League division series. Yankees reliever Joba Chamberlain couldn’t handle the infestation, and the Yankees lost the game and ultimately the series.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/05/sports/04twins-managers-print/merlin_162132462_54690b2d-3d9b-46a7-a67b-453cc207124a-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/05/sports/04twins-managers-print/merlin_162132462_54690b2d-3d9b-46a7-a67b-453cc207124a-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/05/sports/04twins-managers-print/merlin_162132462_54690b2d-3d9b-46a7-a67b-453cc207124a-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/05/sports/04twins-managers-print/merlin_162132462_54690b2d-3d9b-46a7-a67b-453cc207124a-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/05/sports/04twins-managers-print/04twins-managers-sub-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/10/05/sports/04twins-managers-print/04twins-managers-sub-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'