ting, before and after their wedding.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/05/fashion/weddings/the-sexist-undertones-of-wedding-marketing.html', 'snippet': 'Many brides, not so much grooms, see a presumptive and sexist slant on social media and online marketing, before and after their wedding.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Laurie Vazquez, a 36-year-old marketing manager in New York City, had decided to keep her last name after she got married in June. But not everyone seemed to be on board with these plans.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/06/fashion/00Wedding-Onlinesexism/00Wedding-Onlinesexism-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/06/fashion/00Wedding-Onlinesexism/00Wedding-Onlinesexism-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/06/fashion/00Wedding-Onlinesexism/00Wedding-Onlinesexism-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/06/fashion/00Wedding-Onlinesexism/00Wedding-Onlinesexism-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/06/fashion/00Wedding-Onlinesexism/00Wedding-Onlinesexism-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/10/06/fashion/00Wedding-Onlinesexism/00Wedding-Onlinesexism-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'r