150d82cc-c761-5d1d-b4c5-8fc3fabe4421'}, {'abstract': 'A co-op board can choose whatever décor it wants. But it would be wise to get a second opinion.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/05/realestate/can-i-make-my-co-op-change-the-bad-lobby-art.html', 'snippet': 'A co-op board can choose whatever décor it wants. But it would be wise to get a second opinion.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Q: Our Upper West Side co-op decided that we should have a rotating display of art in our lobby, with works chosen by a committee of three. We’re a large co-op with hundreds of residents. While some of the pieces have been O.K., others have been awful. Bad art isn’t just an affront to the senses, it’s bad business. Many of us would prefer to have permanent décor, but neither the board nor the managing agent seem willing to listen, and I was told I couldn’t circulate a petition. What can we do to make our voices heard?', 'print_section': 'RE', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/06/realestate/06Ask/06Ask-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 118, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/06/realestate/06Ask/06Ask-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 118}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/06/realestate/06Ask/06Ask-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 201, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/06/realestate/06Ask/06Ask-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 402, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/06/realestate/06Ask/06Ask-thumbStandard.jpg', 'hei