 Decisions puzzle.', 'lead_paragraph': 'VARIETY PUZZLE — This species of Sunday Variety puzzle is growing on me, I guess, like a fungus. It is gratifying to encounter something in life and realize after several iterations that somehow you are getting better at it, without really “putting your shoulder into it,” as it were. Like moving to a walk-up apartment and realizing after a few months that you do not even notice the hike upstairs. Anyway, consider this encouragement if you are struggling with today’s Fred Piscop construction — trust me, if you keep at it you will get the hang of it too.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Variety: Split Decisions', 'kicker': 'SUNDAY VARIETY COLUMN', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2019-10-05T15:40:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Games', 'section_name': 'Crosswords & Games', 'byline': {'original': 'By Caitlin Lovinger', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Caitlin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lovinger', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/68189214-a3e3-5a39-89b4-523dfda025aa', 'word_count': 331, 'uri': 'nyt://article/68189214-a3e3-5a39-89b4-523dfda025aa'}, {'abstract': 'As Trump made unfounded allegations about Biden and his son, the former vice president was torn over what to do. He now looks more vulnerable than at any point in the campaign.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/05/us/politics/biden-trump-ukraine.html', 'snippet': 'As Trump made unfounded allegations about Biden and his son, the former vice president was torn over what to do. He now looks more vulnerable than at any point in the campaign.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Joseph R. Biden Jr.’s presidential campaign was under attack, and he and his advisers were torn over what to do.', 'print_sect