ue': 'Police Department (Dallas, Tex)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jean, Botham Shem', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Guyger, Amber (1988- )', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Blacks', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Black People', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Dallas (Tex)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-10-06T04:24:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Express', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Neil Vigdor', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Neil', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Vigdor', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2c3ea02a-7ef6-5ee5-80f5-b7d0b1e6c689', 'word_count': 814, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2c3ea02a-7ef6-5ee5-80f5-b7d0b1e6c689'}, {'abstract': 'Elliot Alderson prepares to bring down a shadowy mastermind in the final season of “Mr. Robot.” And the criminally enterprising Shelby family returns for a new season of “Peaky Blinders.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/06/arts/television/whats-on-tv-sunday-mr-robot-and-peaky-blinders.html', 'snippet': 'Elliot Alderson prepares to bring down a shadowy mastermind in the final season of “Mr. Robot.” And the criminally enterprising Shelby family returns for a new season of “Peaky Blinders.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'MR. ROBOT 10 p.m. on USA. After tanking the world’s economy, and then attempting to undo that hack with a bit of code, Elliot Alderson (Rami Malek) has set his sights on taking down Whiterose, the shadowy leader of the Dark Army who has been manipulating him and his gang of vigilantes for her own gain. At the end of Season 3, “characters who thought they were smashing capitalism, winning back their family, bringing back their dead parent or fighting the good fight against cyberterrorism, learned that they were essentially pawns being pushed around a chessboard,” Jeremy Egner wrote in his finale recap for The New York Times. Armed with that information, and a hunger for retribution, the hooded hacker will reunite with his other half, Mr. Robot, working in tandem to destroy “the top one percent of the top one percent.”', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/06/arts/06tvcol-robot/06tvcol-robot-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/06/arts/06tvcol-robot/06tvcol-robot-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/06/arts/06tvcol-robot/06tvcol-robot-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/06/arts/06tvcol-robot/06tvcol-robot-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/06/arts/06tvcol-robot/06tvcol-robot-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/10/06/arts/06tvcol-robot/06tvcol-robot-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/06/arts/06tvcol-robot/06tvcol-robot-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'What’s on TV Sunday: ‘Mr. Robot’ and ‘Peaky 