e attorney general is reviewing it.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/06/us/politics/italy-russia-mifsud-trump.html', 'snippet': 'A Trump adviser met a professor in Rome whose actions figured into the opening of the Russia inquiry in 2016. Now the attorney general is reviewing it.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Attorney General William P. Barr has said he is reviewing the origins of the Russia investigation. As part of the review, Mr. Barr met recently with officials in Italy, where in 2016 a Trump campaign adviser met Joseph Mifsud, a professor whose actions figured prominently into the F.B.I.’s rationale for opening the Russia inquiry.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/06/us/politics/04dc-mifsud2/merlin_145657644_d447e5ca-d8d7-438b-9171-0c23300e1cc1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 427, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/06/us/politics/04dc-mifsud2/merlin_145657644_d447e5ca-d8d7-438b-9171-0c23300e1cc1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 427}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/06/us/politics/04dc-mifsud2/merlin_145657644_d447e5ca-d8d7-438b-9171-0c23300e1cc1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 729, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/06/us/politics/04dc-mifsud2/merlin_145657644_d447e5ca-d8d7-438b-9171-0c23300e1cc1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1459, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/06/us/politics/04dc-mifsud2/04dc-mifsud2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'wid