fter some strange misfires last season.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/06/arts/television/mr-robot-season-4-premiere-recap-e-for-vendetta.html', 'snippet': 'The final season premiere opened with a bang — and was a return to form after some strange misfires last season.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It starts with the death of a main character. It seems, at first, to end with the death of the main character. In between, it plays out like an eerie paranoid thriller against a backdrop of international corruption and capitalism run amok. Written and directed by the series’s creator, Sam Esmail, the fourth and final season premiere of “Mr. Robot” plays to all the show’s strengths and none of its weaknesses. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/06/arts/06mr-robot-recap/merlin_162052854_827e0844-2274-4023-a0bf-14cab6875348-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/06/arts/06mr-robot-recap/merlin_162052854_827e0844-2274-4023-a0bf-14cab6875348-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/06/arts/06mr-robot-recap/merlin_162052854_827e0844-2274-4023-a0bf-14cab6875348-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/06/arts/06mr-robot-recap/merlin_162052854_827e0844-2274-4023-a0bf-14cab6875348-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/06/arts/06mr-robot-recap/06mr-robot-recap-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75,