7', 'word_count': 934, 'uri': 'nyt://article/15c277e9-cf23-550d-a0c3-4c709aacd617'}, {'abstract': 'According to the journalist’s account, an official at Dulles International Airport repeatedly asked: “You write propaganda, right?”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/08/business/journalist-us-customs-border-agent.html', 'snippet': 'According to the journalist’s account, an official at Dulles International Airport repeatedly asked: “You write propaganda, right?”', 'lead_paragraph': 'For five years, Ben Watson served in the United States Army, spending part of that time in public affairs in Kandahar, Afghanistan, writing news releases, working as a combat cameraman and accompanying a reporter who was embedded with the troops. Now he is on the other side of the divide, working as the news editor at Defense One, a digital publication owned by Atlantic Media that covers military issues and global security.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/08/business/08CUSTOMS-01/merlin_162385740_32d07fd4-5efa-4272-ba61-dc64570df84b-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 801, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/08/business/08CUSTOMS-01/merlin_162385740_32d07fd4-5efa-4272-ba61-dc64570df84b-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 801}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/08/business/08CUSTOMS-01/merlin_162385740_32d07fd4-5efa-4272-ba61-dc64570df84b-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 768, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/08/business/08CUSTOMS-01/merlin_162385740_32d07fd4-5efa-4272-ba61-dc64570df84b-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1800, 'width': 1349, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/08/business/08CUSTOMS-01/08CUSTOMS-01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/10/08/business/08CUSTOMS-01/08CUSTOMS-01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/08/business/08CUSTOMS-01/08CUSTOMS-01-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Journalist Says He Was Hounded by a U.S. Customs Agent', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': ' Border Agent To Journalist:  ‘You Write Propaganda?’', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Watson, Ben (Journalist)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Defense One', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Customs and Border Protection (US)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'News and News Media', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Airport Security', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Atlantic Media Co', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-10-08T22:18:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Marc Tracy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Marc', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Tracy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/530d3884-bdb1-5c41-bf4a-659edd6fb686', 'word_count': 649, 'uri': 'nyt://article/530d3884-bdb1-5c41-bf4a-659edd6fb686'}, {'abstract': 'The Yankees’ 22-year-old infielder delivered big hits and highlight-reel defensive stops in a sweep of the Twins. His improvement started with grueling off-season workouts.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/08/sports/baseball/gleyber-torres-yankees.html', 'snippet': 'The Yankees’ 22-year-old infielder delivered big hits and highlight-reel defensive stops in a sweep of the Twins. His improvement started with grueling off-season workouts.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MINNEAPOLIS — The phone call came in early December, in the dead of baseball’s off-season, when players are on vacation and recovering from the grueling season. Yankees infielder Gleyber Torres, though, was ready to start training.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/08/sports/08yankeesfolo1/merlin_162352692_c8410beb-12e1-4402-83f0-f32a02593d7d-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/08/sports/08yankeesfolo1/merlin_162352692_c8410beb-12e1-4402-83f0-f32a02593d7d-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/08/sports/08yankeesfolo1/merlin_162352692_c8410beb-12e1-4402-83f0-f32a02593d7d-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/08/sports/08yankeesfolo1/merlin_162352692_c8410beb-12e1-4402-83f0-f32a02593d7d-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/08/sports/08yankeesfolo1/08yankeesfolo1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/10/08/sports/08yankeesfolo1/08yankeesfolo1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/08/sports/08yankeesfolo1/08yankeesfolo1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Gleyber Torres Has Been Preparing for This Since December', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Two-Time All-Star Gets Better', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Minnesota Twins', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Yankees', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Torres, Gleyber (1996- )', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Playoff Games', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-10-08T22:34:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By James Wagner', 'person': [{'firstname': 'James', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Wagner', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c49c2457-1555-5f8f-ba96-89f3c8950b24', 'word_count': 926, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c49c2457-1555-5f8f-ba96-89f3c8950b24'}, {'abstract': 'The Vermont senator said he would “change the nature” of his campaign. He also acknowledged that voters would take his health into account when deciding whether to support him.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/08/us/politics/bernie-sanders-heart-attack.html', 'snippet': 'The Vermont senator said he would “change the nature” of his campaign. He also acknowledged that voters would take his health into account when deciding whether to support him.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BURLINGTON, Vt. — Senator Bernie Sanders, in a striking concession for a leading presidential candidate, said on Tuesday that he planned to slow down his pace on the campaign trail after suffering a heart attack a week ago, and acknowledged that voters would likely consider his health when deciding whether to support him.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Bernie Sanders Says He Will Slow His Campaign Pace After Heart Attack', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'After Heart Attack, Sanders Will Slow Pace of His Campaign', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2020', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Heart', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sanders, Bernard', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Burlington (Vt)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-10-08T22:38:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Politics', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sydney Ember and Jonathan Martin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sydney', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ember', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Jonathan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Martin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/27333d9c-55d8-5422-a155-59bf1e652025', 'word_count': 1304, 'uri': 'nyt://article/27333d9c-55d8-5422-a155-59bf1e652025'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Baldwin complained that he had been victimized by a company that offered tickets to see the Statue of Liberty.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/08/nyregion/alec-baldwin-statue-liberty.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Baldwin complained that he had been victimized by a company that offered tickets to see the Statue of Liberty.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Alec Baldwin considers himself a consummate, “savvy” New Yorker, and like most, he is not exactly bashful about expressing his views. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/08/nyregion/08statueliberty1/merlin_125538818_bee9a3ba-a559-459b-af00-71ce77692b63-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/08/nyregion/08statueliberty1/merlin_125538818_bee9a3ba-a559-459b-af00-71ce77692b63-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/08/nyregion/08statueliberty1/merlin_125538818_bee9a3ba-a559-459b-af00-71ce77692b63-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/08/nyregion/08statueliberty1/merlin_125538818_bee9a3ba-a559-459b-af00-71ce77692b63-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/08/nyregion/08statueliberty1/08statueliberty1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/10/08/nyregion/08statueliberty1/08statueliberty1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/08/nyregion/08statueliberty1/08statueliberty1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Alec Baldwin Gripes About Tour Boat ‘Scam,’ and N.Y.C. Cracks Down', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Plan: Visit to the Statue. Result: Taken for a Ride.', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Statue of Liberty', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Frauds and Swindling', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Statue Cruises', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Baldwin, Alec', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'de Blasio, Bill', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Battery Park (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Liberty Island (NYC)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-10-08T22:47:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jeffery C. Mays and Derek M. Norman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jeffery', 'middlename': 'C.', 'lastname': 'Mays', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Derek', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/470f7c82-3647-5cda-87ed-8b5bce63e152', 'word_count': 817, 'uri': 'nyt://article/470f7c82-3647-5cda-87ed-8b5bce63e152'}, {'abstract': 'So talented yet so vulnerable — like all the leading contenders for the Democratic nomination.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/08/opinion/buttigieg-2020.html', 'snippet': 'So talented yet so vulnerable — like all the leading contenders for the Democratic nomination.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If I dreamed up an ideal Democratic opponent for President Trump in 2020, I’d locate that candidate in the industrial Midwest. That’s where Hillary Clinton lost the last election, and it’s where the next one could very well be decided.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '27', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/08/opinion/08bruniWeb/08bruniWeb-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 389, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/08/opinion/08bruniWeb/08bruniWeb-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 389}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/08/opinion/08bruniWeb/08bruniWeb-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 663, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/08/opinion/08bruniWeb/08bruniWeb-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1327, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/08/opinion/08bruniWeb/08bruniWeb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/10/08/opinion/08bruniWeb/08bruniWeb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/08/opinion/08bruniWeb/08bruniWeb-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Agonizing Imperfection of Pete Buttigieg', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Buttigieg’s Agonizing  Imperfection', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Buttigieg, Pete (1982- )', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2020', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Democratic Party', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-10-08T23:08:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Frank Bruni', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Frank', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bruni', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/cc6cfe22-1fe1-59fc-925f-1327d665a791', 'word_count': 1005, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cc6cfe22-1fe1-59fc-925f-1327d665a791'}, {'abstract': 'The young Ukrainian leader is jammed between the rock of Vladimir Putin’s aggression and the hard place of President Trump’s demands.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/08/opinion/ukraine-zelensky.html', 'snippet': 'The young Ukrainian leader is jammed between the rock of Vladimir Putin’s aggression and the hard place of President Trump’s demands.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In April, Ukrainian voters took a desperate gamble and elected as their president a television performer who played a humble 30-something schoolteacher, Vasyl Petrovych Holoborodko, on a show called “Servant of the People.” On the show, a rant by Mr. Holoborodko against Ukraine’s culture of corruption had gone viral, capturing the mood of a young country profoundly frustrated by the state of affairs and ready for change.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 