received across the country.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/09/us/politics/donald-trump-impeachment-news.html', 'snippet': 'A quieter day in Washington provided a chance to look at how the still-nascent investigation is being received across the country.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This morning’s episode of “The Daily” followed Representative Elissa Slotkin, a moderate Democrat, as she went to three forums in her mid-Michigan district — including one at the East Lansing pie bakery where I worked the 5 a.m. shift in high school! Her takeaway: Many voters want an investigation that feels deliberate. “There’s no need to come out of a meeting where you’ve heard some new testimony and just start talking to the press about how this seals the deal for you, and you’re done,” she said.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/09/us/politics/09dc-impeachbriefing/merlin_162388722_a3e46bed-fe72-4c63-b172-2418c47becf8-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/09/us/politics/09dc-impeachbriefing/merlin_162388722_a3e46bed-fe72-4c63-b172-2418c47becf8-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/09/us/politics/09dc-impeachbriefing/merlin_162388722_a3e46bed-fe72-4c63-b172-2418c47becf8-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/09/us/politics/09dc-impeachbriefing/merlin_162388722_a3e46bed-fe72-4c63-b172-2418c47becf8-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': 