ing fund-raisers with wealthy contributors while promising not to actually disarm in a potential matchup with President Trump.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/09/us/politics/elizabeth-warren-fundraising.html', 'snippet': 'Elizabeth Warren is seeking to find a balance — disavowing fund-raisers with wealthy contributors while promising not to actually disarm in a potential matchup with President Trump.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As Senator Elizabeth Warren has surged toward the top of the Democratic presidential field, she has found herself torn between two competing imperatives: maintaining her perceived purity from the influence of wealthy contributors and not ceding any financial advantage to President Trump, who is busy breaking fund-raising records.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/09/us/politics/09warrenmoney/merlin_162096807_c63a0bca-2d9c-485f-bd2a-631a293e34c4-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 392, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/09/us/politics/09warrenmoney/merlin_162096807_c63a0bca-2d9c-485f-bd2a-631a293e34c4-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 392}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/09/us/politics/09warrenmoney/merlin_162096807_c63a0bca-2d9c-485f-bd2a-631a293e34c4-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 669, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/09/us/politics/09warrenmoney/merlin_162096807_c63a0bca-2d9c-485f-bd2a-631a293e34c4-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1338, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type