s available.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/09/opinion/trump-impeachment-constitution.html', 'snippet': 'With a full-on confrontation between the House and the president, no simple resolution is available.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For the first time since President Richard Nixon refused to turn over the White House tapes, the United States is facing a genuine constitutional crisis.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/09/opinion/09Feldman/09Feldman-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/09/opinion/09Feldman/09Feldman-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/09/opinion/09Feldman/09Feldman-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/09/opinion/09Feldman/09Feldman-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/09/opinion/09Feldman/09Feldman-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/10/09/opinion/09Feldman/09Feldman-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/09/opinion/09Feldman/09Feldman-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'This Is a Constitutional Crisis. What Happens Next?', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'And Now We’re in a Constitutional Crisis', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Trump-Ukraine Whistle-blower Complaint and Impeachment Inquiry', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Constitution (US)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Impeachment', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Democratic Party', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'House of Representatives', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Supreme Court (US)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Executive Privilege, Doctrine of', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-10-09T15:50:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Noah Feldman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Noah', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Feldman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/bd88db34-70bd-5cec-9aaa-e7974a14ed27', 'word_count': 1225, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bd88db34-70bd-5cec-9aaa-e7974a14ed27'}, {'abstract': 'Julien Dossena, the creative director of Paco Rabanne, is fueled by an unholy combination of period pieces and futuristic design.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/09/t-magazine/julien-dossena-paco-rabanne.html', 'snippet': 'Julien Dossena, the creative director of Paco Rabanne, is fueled by an unholy combination of period pieces and futuristic design.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Growing up in a small fishing village in France near the coast of Brittany, Julien Dossena, the 37-year-old creative director of Paco Rabanne, spent hours sketching speedboats, whales, medieval knights and sultry female superheroes. In his late teens, he turned his focus to fashion: “My dad owned a nightclub, and hanging out there, I became obsessed with evening wear — it felt very ‘Boogie Nights,’” he says. “Then I got into skateboarding culture, ’90s streetwear and grunge through magazines like The Face and i-D.” He also discovered the work of Belgian designers, including Martin Margiela and Ann Demeulemeester, whom he found to be “a refreshing antithesis to the uptight and terrifying world of Paris fashion,” and enrolled at La Cambre National Visual Arts School in Brussels. Afterward, in 2008, he landed an internship at Balenciaga, where he eventually became a senior designer. He left the brand in 2012 and started his own line, Atto, and then took a freelance gig at Paco Rabanne, the Paris label that had struggled to find its footing following the retirement of its Basque founder in 1999. Within months, Dossena was running the show.', 'print_section': 'M2', 'print_page': '72', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/09/t-magazine/09tmag-dossena-slide-EXN3/09tmag-dossena-slide-EXN3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 886, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/09/t-magazine/09tmag-dossena-slide-EXN3/09tmag-dossena-slide-EXN3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 886}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/09/t-magazine/09tmag-dossena-slide-EXN3/09tmag-dossena-slide-EXN3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 694, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/09/t-maga