to confront his career choices — and his director’s view of his career choices.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/10/movies/will-smith-gemini-man.html', 'snippet': 'With “Gemini Man,” about an assassin and his much younger clone, the actor was forced to confront his career choices — and his director’s view of his career choices.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SAN FRANCISCO — In “Gemini Man,” Will Smith plays Henry Brogan, a supernaturally gifted assassin, as well as his clone, Junior, who besides looking exactly like a young Will Smith, circa “The Fresh Prince of Bel-Air,” is out to murder him. Before filming began, the director Ang Lee curated a collection of clips from the early years of Smith’s three-decades-long filmography, including scenes from “Six Degrees of Separation” and “Men in Black,” and reviewed them with the actor, like a football coach running game tape. ', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/13/arts/13WILL-SMITH/13WILL-SMITH-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 446, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/13/arts/13WILL-SMITH/13WILL-SMITH-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 446}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/13/arts/13WILL-SMITH/13WILL-SMITH-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 762, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/13/arts/13WILL-SMITH/13WILL-SMITH-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1524, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/13/arts/13WILL-SMITH/13WILL-SMIT