ticle/1ad6537e-0fb3-5f7d-9905-80d802dde803'}, {'abstract': 'Many animals, including humans, have DNA left over from ancient viral infections. In koalas, researchers are studying the process in real time.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/10/science/koala-retrovirus-evolution.html', 'snippet': 'Many animals, including humans, have DNA left over from ancient viral infections. In koalas, researchers are studying the process in real time.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Koalas have been running into hard times. They have suffered for years from habitat destruction, dog attacks, automobile accidents. But that’s only the beginning. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/15/science/10SCI-KOALAS1/merlin_162435396_4223b9f3-aba9-4cff-97e2-dbff056cda27-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/15/science/10SCI-KOALAS1/merlin_162435396_4223b9f3-aba9-4cff-97e2-dbff056cda27-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/15/science/10SCI-KOALAS1/merlin_162435396_4223b9f3-aba9-4cff-97e2-dbff056cda27-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/15/science/10SCI-KOALAS1/merlin_162435396_4223b9f3-aba9-4cff-97e2-dbff056cda27-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/15/science/10SCI-KOALAS1/10SCI-KOALAS1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_n