 fences.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/11/theater/prison-arts-colorado.html', 'snippet': 'Thirty Colorado inmates staged “One Flew Over the Cuckoo’s Nest” for nearby prisons. For some, it was the first time in years they were outside 20-foot walls and razor fences.', 'lead_paragraph': 'STERLING, Colo. — The cast was strip-searched before boarding the bus to their show. The leading man was shackled so tightly that he performed with abrasions on his wrists. And the moment the men finished their bows and the house lights came up, they had to slip out of costume and back into green prison uniforms.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/10/arts/10surfacing-prisonplay1/merlin_160908900_bfd341ba-8b23-4428-830b-a7fd291d7ea3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/11/10/arts/10surfacing-prisonplay1/merlin_160908900_bfd341ba-8b23-4428-830b-a7fd291d7ea3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/10/arts/10surfacing-prisonplay1/merlin_160908900_bfd341ba-8b23-4428-830b-a7fd291d7ea3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/10/arts/10surfacing-prisonplay1/merlin_160908900_bfd341ba-8b23-4428-830b-a7fd291d7ea3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/10/arts/10surfacing-prisonplay1/11surfacing-prisonplay1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbSt