 Lennon in “A Hard Day’s Night” and won a Tony for playing four women in “Stop the World — I Want to Get Off.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/11/movies/anna-quayle-dead.html', 'snippet': 'She bantered with John Lennon in “A Hard Day’s Night” and won a Tony for playing four women in “Stop the World — I Want to Get Off.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'A young John Lennon is hiding out in a backstage hallway in “A Hard Day’s Night” (1964), and only one woman — a mod Londoner with short, dark hair, a slouchy sweater and eyeglasses on a chain — seems to recognize him. But after some sexy Beatles banter, she concludes, “You don’t look like him at all.”', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/12/obituaries/12Quayle-obit1/11Quayle1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 580, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/12/obituaries/12Quayle-obit1/11Quayle1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 580}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/12/obituaries/12Quayle-obit1/11Quayle1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 949, 'width': 981, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/12/obituaries/12Quayle-obit1/11Quayle1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 949, 'width': 981, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/12/obituaries/12Quayle-obit1/11Quayle1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/10/12/obituaries/12Quayle-obit1/11Quayle1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth'