tion': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/887cd97b-e013-53fd-88a6-7a205a54a45f', 'word_count': 1296, 'uri': 'nyt://article/887cd97b-e013-53fd-88a6-7a205a54a45f'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. McAleenan oversaw a border security agency that grappled with the most crossings at the southwestern border in more than a decade, prompting the ire of the president.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/11/us/politics/kevin-mcaleenan-homeland-security.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. McAleenan oversaw a border security agency that grappled with the most crossings at the southwestern border in more than a decade, prompting the ire of the president.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — President Trump announced Friday the resignation of Kevin K. McAleenan, the acting secretary for the Department of Homeland Security who spent his six-month tenure trying to curb a surge of asylum seekers at the southwestern border while managing a turbulent relationship with a president intent on restricting immigration.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/06/21/us/politics/21dc-dhs/merlin_155249631_86551944-8cd3-45d7-a05d-941574b6f027-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/06/21/us/politics/21dc-dhs/merlin_155249631_86551944-8cd3-45d7-a05d-941574b6f027-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/06/21/us/politics/21dc-dhs/merlin_155249631_86551944-8cd3-45d7-a05d-941574b6f027-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/06/21/us/politi