talk much about the banned coach.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/11/sports/olympics/salazar-farah-chicago-marathon.html', 'snippet': 'Galen Rupp, Mo Farah and Jordan Hasay trained with Alberto Salazar. In Chicago to run the marathon there, they didn’t want to talk much about the banned coach.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CHICAGO — During the stretch run leading up to a major marathon, Jordan Hasay could expect to start receiving multiple phone calls per day from her Nike Oregon Project coach, Alberto Salazar, who would guide her through her final days of training.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/11/sports/11salazar2/merlin_162540363_5b5be47c-a8ae-487c-9370-c59286ca01ea-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/11/sports/11salazar2/merlin_162540363_5b5be47c-a8ae-487c-9370-c59286ca01ea-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/11/sports/11salazar2/merlin_162540363_5b5be47c-a8ae-487c-9370-c59286ca01ea-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/11/sports/11salazar2/merlin_162540363_5b5be47c-a8ae-487c-9370-c59286ca01ea-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/11/sports/11salazar2/merlin_162540363_5b5be47c-a8ae-487c-9370-c59286ca01ea-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/10/11/sports/11salazar2/merlin_162540363_5b5be47c-a8ae-487c-9370-c59286ca01ea-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/11/sports/11salazar2/merlin_162540363_5b5be47c-a8ae-487c-9370-c59286ca01ea-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'In Chicago, Salazar’s Runners Stick to a Script', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Chicago Marathon', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Doping (Sports)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Salazar, Alberto', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rupp, Galen', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Farah, Mo', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hasay, Jordan (1991- )', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-10-12T00:16:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Olympics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jeff Arnold', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jeff', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Arnold', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a8c367dd-cae6-5eb0-a7d7-edf847c2652f', 'word_count': 850, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a8c367dd-cae6-5eb0-a7d7-edf847c2652f'}, {'abstract': 'As Canada’s election campaign heads into its final week, neither of the country’s major parties have managed to shift the vote.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/11/world/canada/voters-liberals-conservatives.html', 'snippet': 'As Canada’s election campaign heads into its final week, neither of the country’s major parties have managed to shift the vote.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In this year’s election campaign, millions of dollars have been spent, thousand of kilometers traveled and hundreds of speeches made. And the result? Just as they were on the first day of campaigning the Liberals and the Conservatives remain deadlocked in a tie for the popular vote.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/11/world/11canadaletter-debate/merlin_162497679_0a42e64e-03f8-48e5-8620-1a085f0af5f9-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 376, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/11/world/11canadaletter-debate/merlin_162497679_0a42e64e-03f8-48e5-8620-1a085f0af5f9-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 376}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/11/world/11canadaletter-debate/merlin_162497679_0a42e64e-03f8-48e5-8620-1a085f0af5f9-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 642, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/11/world/11canadaletter-debate/merlin_162497679_0a42e64e-03f8-48e5-8620-1a085f0af5f9-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1285, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/11/world/11canadaletter-debate/11canadaletter-debate-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/10/11/world/11canadaletter-debate/11canadaletter-debate-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/11/world/11canadaletter-debate/11canadaletter-debate-thumbL