': 'This vacation home is in the front, ocean-facing row of the Pajaro Dunes resort community, a collection of beach houses and rental properties along 1.5 miles of Monterey Bay, about 21 miles southeast of Santa Cruz and 30 miles northeast of Monterey, as the road runs. The architect, William Logan, of Palo Alto, Calif., designed the redwood-plywood-sided building to offer ocean views and access to outdoor decks from most of the rooms, while screening the neighbors. The sellers are the second owners of the house.', 'print_section': 'RE', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/20/realestate/14WYG-CA-slide-18HI/14WYG-CA-slide-18HI-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 425, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/20/realestate/14WYG-CA-slide-18HI/14WYG-CA-slide-18HI-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 425}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/20/realestate/14WYG-CA-slide-18HI/14WYG-CA-slide-18HI-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 725, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/20/realestate/14WYG-CA-slide-18HI/14WYG-CA-slide-18HI-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1450, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/20/realestate/14WYG-CA-slide-18HI/14WYG-CA-slide-18HI-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/10/20/realestate/14WYG-CA-slide-18HI/14WYG-CA-slide-18HI-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'su