rived at Citi Field with a vision of the genre that’s no longer rooted in the city.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/14/arts/music/rolling-loud.html', 'snippet': 'The touring multiday rap festival arrived at Citi Field with a vision of the genre that’s no longer rooted in the city.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Playboi Carti — slender as a string bean, flexible as a yogi, his dreads dyed almost the same beige as his cropped jacket — bounded onto the main stage at the Rolling Loud festival Saturday night to rile up his faithful. Carti is an impressionist rapper, slurring together syllables and murmurs into cloudy chant-along mantras. But onstage, he was a dynamo — jumping wildly, curling his body into a parabola as he shouted to the sky, and inciting his tens of thousands of fans to mosh.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/15/arts/14rollingloud-6/merlin_162682686_3e72edba-3932-4a7f-be3a-3b06122151ce-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 429, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/15/arts/14rollingloud-6/merlin_162682686_3e72edba-3932-4a7f-be3a-3b06122151ce-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 429}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/15/arts/14rollingloud-6/merlin_162682686_3e72edba-3932-4a7f-be3a-3b06122151ce-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 731, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/15/arts/14rollingloud-6/merlin_162682686_3e72edba-3932-4a7f-be3a-3b06122151ce-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1463, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': 