ponse to Turkey’s incursion into Syria, an invasion for which he himself had cleared the way for.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/14/us/politics/trump-turkey-tariffs.html', 'snippet': 'President Trump also said he was doubling tariffs on imports of Turkish steel in response to Turkey’s incursion into Syria, an invasion for which he himself had cleared the way for.', 'lead_paragraph': 'President Trump said on Monday that he was imposing sanctions on Turkish government agencies and officials in response to Turkey’s incursion into Syria, an invasion that he himself had cleared the way for by withdrawing American troops.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/14/us/politics/14dc-turkeytariffs/merlin_143567568_82892f8e-7ae1-4d92-a061-94dd40fc9459-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/14/us/politics/14dc-turkeytariffs/merlin_143567568_82892f8e-7ae1-4d92-a061-94dd40fc9459-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/14/us/politics/14dc-turkeytariffs/merlin_143567568_82892f8e-7ae1-4d92-a061-94dd40fc9459-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/14/us/politics/14dc-turkeytariffs/merlin_143567568_82892f8e-7ae1-4d92-a061-94dd40fc9459-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/14/us/politics/14dc-turkeytariffs/14dc-turkeytariffs-thumbStandard.jpg', 'heig