ame': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Podcasts', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Comedy and Humor', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Office Ladies (Radio Program)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ACTORS AND ACTRESSES', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fischer, Jenna', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kinsey, Angela', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'The Office (TV Program)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Earwolf: A Stitcher Network', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-10-15T16:32:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Television', 'byline': {'original': 'By Phoebe Lett', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Phoebe', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lett', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/31fd4662-e776-5116-82af-0e83b1c97862', 'word_count': 1465, 'uri': 'nyt://article/31fd4662-e776-5116-82af-0e83b1c97862'}, {'abstract': '‘The Two Faces of a Bamileke Woman’ and ‘Chez Jolie Coiffure’ offer Cameroonian women the chance to speak for themselves.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/15/movies/chez-jolie-coiffure-and-the-two-faces-of-a-bamileke-woman-review.html', 'snippet': '‘The Two Faces of a Bamileke Woman’ and ‘Chez Jolie Coiffure’ offer Cameroonian women the chance to speak for themselves.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Cameroonian and Belgian filmmaker, Rosine Mbakam, makes a remarkable debut with two documentary essay films that explore the identities of West African women at home and abroad. “The Two Faces of a Bamileke Woman” centers Mbakam and her family as the subjects. She returns to her mother’s home in Cameroon after years spent abroad in Belgium, and she participates in her mother’s once-familiar routines with an outsider’s eyes. By contrast, in “Chez Jolie Coiffure,” Mbakam positions her camera inside the world that she films, watching and speaking with Sabine, a braider from Cameroon who tends to the hair and welfare of her community in Brussels.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/14/arts/mbakam1/merlin_162489294_6e85928d-3b4e-4de8-b03e-fb9f16d6087e-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/14/arts/mbakam1/merlin_162489294_6e85928d-3b4e-4de8-b03e-fb9f16d6087e-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/14/arts/mbakam1/merlin_162489294_6e85928d-3b4e-4de8-b03e-fb9f16d6087e-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/14/arts/mbakam1/merlin_162489294_6e85928d-3b4e-4de8-b03e-fb9f16d6087e-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1152, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/14/arts/mbakam1/mbakam1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/10/14/arts/mbakam1/mbakam1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/14/arts/mbakam1/mbakam1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Review: Two Films From Rosine Mbakam Explore West African Women’s Identity', 'kicker': 'Critic’s Pick', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Director Explores West African Women’s Identities', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Documentary Films and Programs', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mbakam, Rosine', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'The Two Faces of a Bamileke Woman (Movie)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Chez Jolie Coiffure (Movie)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Cameroon', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Women and Girls', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-10-15T16:57:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By Teo Bugbee', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Teo', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bugbee', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/73cba28e-2d98-5e38-91cf-38fd26374139', 'word_count': 445, 'uri': 'nyt://article/73cba28e-2d98-5e38-91cf-38fd26374139'}, {'abstract': 'Two shootings during the long holiday weekend in San Juan had people worried about a rash of drug violence and other crime.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/15/us/puerto-rico-shooting.html', 'snippet': 'Two shootings during the long holiday weekend in San Juan had people worried about a rash of drug violence and other crime.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SAN JUAN, P.R. — The terrifying storm of gunfire broke out in the dark on Monday, piercing the early evening calm at a public housing complex near the University of Puerto Rico with hundreds of loud shots. Women screamed and dogs barked. After it was over, five people lay dead. A sixth person who was injured later died. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/15/us/15puerto-rico03/merlin_162753714_bcee618d-a721-4f64-b023-c6b2d7a59e87-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/15/us/15puerto-rico03/merlin_162753714_bcee618d-a721-4f64-b023-c6b2d7a59e87-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/15/us/15puerto-rico03/merlin_162753714_bcee618d-a721-4f64-b023-c6b2d7a59e87-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/15/us/15puerto-rico03/merlin_162753714_bcee618d-a721-4f64-b023-c6b2d7a59e87-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/15/us/15puerto-rico03/merlin_162753714_bcee618d-a721-4f64-b023-c6b2d7a59e87-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/10/15/us/15puerto-rico03/merlin_162753714_bcee618d-a721-4f64-b023-c6b2d7a59e87-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/15/us/15puerto-rico03/merlin_162753714_bcee618d-a721-4f64-b023-c6b2d7a59e87-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '6 Killed in Shootout as Violence Rattles Puerto Rican Capital', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '6 Dead in Shootout in Puerto Rico’s Capital', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mass Shootings', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Crime and Criminals', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Puerto Rico', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'San Juan (Puerto Rico)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-10-15T16:57:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Patricia Mazzei', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Patricia', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mazzei', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2bf8ee66-ffc7-5eb3-95cd-44930e8e5aeb', 'word_count': 900, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2bf8ee66-ffc7-5eb3-95cd-44930e8e5aeb'}, {'abstract': 'Gerrit Cole outlasted Yankees ace Luis Severino and held the Yankees’ bats in check as Houston took a two-games-to-one lead in the American League Championship Series.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/15/sports/baseball/yankees-astros-game-3-score.html', 'snippet': 'Gerrit Cole outlasted Yankees ace Luis Severino and held the Yankees’ bats in check as Houston took a two-games-to-one lead in the American League Championship Series.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The last time Gerrit Cole, one of the aces of the Houston Astros’ starting rotation, lost a game was May 22, when he coughed up six runs over five innings in a 9-4 loss to the Chicago White Sox. Since then, his run of dominance has been simply stunning: 169⅓ innings, 258 strikeouts and a 1.59 E.R.A.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/15/sports/15alcs-live-7/15alcs-live-7-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/15/sports/15alcs-live-7/15alcs-live-7-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/15/sports/15alcs-live-7/15alcs-live-7-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/15/sports/15alcs-live-7/15alcs-live-7-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/15/sports/15alcs-live-7/15alcs-live-7-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/10/15/sports/15alcs-live-7/15alcs-live-7-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/15/sports/15alcs-live-7/15alcs-live-7-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'How the Astros Stifled the Yankees in Game 3', 'kicker': 'Astros 4, Yankees 1', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Ex-Yankee Fan Quiets 50,000 Current Ones', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Playoff Games', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Yankees', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Houston Astros', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cole,