eir views in an attempt to find daylight between them.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What Democratic Candidates Said About Impeaching Trump at the Debate', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Trump-Ukraine Whistle-blower Complaint and Impeachment Inquiry', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Impeachment', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2020', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Debates (Political)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Democratic Party', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-10-16T00:10:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Politics', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Matt Stevens', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Matt', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Stevens', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b778ce43-bc09-56ef-ab37-39513a287368', 'word_count': 815, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b778ce43-bc09-56ef-ab37-39513a287368'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Steyer is a hedge fund billionaire who has funded efforts to impeach President Trump and regularly decries “the corporate stranglehold on democracy.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/15/us/politics/who-is-tom-steyer.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Steyer is a hedge fund billionaire who has funded efforts to impeach President Trump and regularly decries “the corporate stranglehold on democracy.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Tom Steyer, who made his first appearance in the Democratic debates on Tuesday night, is a hedge fund billionaire who has funded efforts to impeach President Trump and regularly decries “the corporate stranglehold on democracy.” ', 'source': 'The New York Ti