humbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Lesson of the Day: ‘48 Hours in the Strange and Beautiful World of TikTok’', 'kicker': 'current events', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2019-10-16T08:00:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Learning', 'section_name': 'The Learning Network', 'byline': {'original': 'By Natalie Proulx', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Natalie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Proulx', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c9ddcd48-0dbe-5b04-84bc-37ff5542567c', 'word_count': 627, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c9ddcd48-0dbe-5b04-84bc-37ff5542567c'}, {'abstract': 'Famed for purported anti-inflammatory and antioxidant properties, the botanical is hailed for helping a host of conditions. Is that true?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/16/style/self-care/turmeric-benefits.html', 'snippet': 'Famed for purported anti-inflammatory and antioxidant properties, the botanical is hailed for helping a host of conditions. Is that true?', 'lead_paragraph': 'Have you noticed lattes, ice cream and smoothies with a tawny hue? That could be a sign of a not-so-secret ingredient: turmeric. The botanical is omnipresent in health food aisles, in the form of pills and powders.', 'print_section': 'F', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/21/fashion/21scam-tumeric/21scam--05-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/21/fashion/21scam-tumeric/21scam--05-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/21/fashion/21scam-tumeric/21scam--05-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/21/fashion/21scam-tumeric/21scam--05-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/21/fashion/21scam-tumeric/21scam--05-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/10/21/fashion/21scam-tumeric/21scam--05-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/21/fashion/21scam-tumeric/21scam--05-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'What Are the Benefits of Turmeric?', 'kicker': 'SCAM OR NOT', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Botanical Garden Of Health Claims', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Turmeric (Spice)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dietary Supplements and Herbal Remedies', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Spices', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Alternative and Complementary Medicine', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Diet and Nutrition', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'your-feed-selfcare', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Research', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-10-16T09:00:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Style', 'subsection_name': 'Self-Care', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dawn MacKeen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dawn', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'MacKeen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c15fda60-0db6-56e6-b63a-2762985998ee', 'word_count': 1234, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c15fda60-0db6-56e6-b63a-2762985998ee'}, {'abstract': 'Looking to punch up your eggs? Or add some zing to your salad? Just give it a little zhug.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/16/magazine/zhug-yemeni-sauce-recipe.html', 'snippet': 'Looking to punch up your eggs? Or add some zing to your salad? Just give it a little zhug.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For the entirety of Prune’s 20 years, I’ve confined myself — with pretty strict discipline — to cooking within a European-and-Mediterranean idiom. It has been two decades of salsa verde, gremolata, sauce gribiche and maître d’hôtel butter, with all the rest doused in olive oil. Of course, giving yourself the entire European-and-Mediterranean pantry is hardly a confinement. Somehow it has never even proved to be a monotony. It has just been a nonnegotiable outline of territory on a map, so that we all know how far we can go and what we are meant to be doing as we cook menu after menu after menu, season after season, six new menus a year, 20 solid years in a row. And that’s not counting desserts.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/20/magazine/20mag-eat-01/20mag-eat-01-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/20/magazine/20mag-eat-01/20mag-eat-01-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/20/magazine/20mag-eat-01/20mag-eat-01-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/20/magazine/20mag-eat-01/20mag-eat-01-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1536, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/20/magazine/20mag-eat-01/20mag-eat-01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/10/20/magazine/20mag-eat-01/20mag-eat-01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/20/magazine/20mag-eat-01/20mag-eat-01-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'This Knockout Spicy Sauce From Yemen Will Improve Almost Any Dish', 'kicker': 'Eat ', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'This Knockout Spicy Sauce From Yemen Will Improve Almost Any Dish', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Prune (Manhattan, NY, Restaurant)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sauces', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Salads', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Recipes', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Yemen', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Yemeni-Americans', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-10-16T09:00:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Magazine', 'section_name': 'Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Gabrielle Hamilton', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Gabrielle', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hamilton', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/04ecea03-740e-53ea-a6be-6164a61ec0de', 'word_count': 907, 'uri': 'nyt://article/04ecea03-740e-53ea-a6be-6164a61ec0de'}, {'abstract': 'Proponents claim that activated charcoal is a “natural detoxifier” that can remove harmful substances from the body.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/16/style/self-care/activated-charcoal-benefits.html', 'snippet': 'Proponents claim that activated charcoal is a “natural detoxifier” that can remove harmful substances from the body.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Active charcoal comes in many forms: toothpaste; powders, black-colored ice-cream, or “goth lattes.” On Instagram, it is used as a prop. Medically, activated charcoal is used in emergency hospital settings, typically to absorb drugs after an overdose.', 'print_section': 'F', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/21/fashion/21scam-charcoal/21scam--03-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/21/fashion/21scam-charcoal/21scam--03-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/21/fashion/21scam-charcoal/21scam--03-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/21/fashion/21scam-charcoal/21scam--03-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/21/fashion/21scam-charcoal/21scam-charcoal-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/10/21/fashion/21scam-charcoal/21scam-charcoal-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/21/fashion/21scam-charcoal/21scam-charcoal-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'What Is Activated Charcoal Used For, and Does it Really Work?', 'kicker': 'SCAM OR NOT', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'No Stone Unturned To Find a Remedy', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Charcoal', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drugs (Pharmaceuticals)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York City Poison Control Center', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Diet and Nutrition', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Food Additives', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Regulation and Deregulation of Industry', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'your-feed-selfcare', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-10-16T09:00:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Style', 'subsection_name': 'Self-Care', 'byline': {'original': 'By Amitha Kalaichandran', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Amitha', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kalaichandran', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/288b3b2c-868e-502f-be0c-31b9a23f37c8', 'word_count': 634, 'uri': 'nyt://article/288b3b2c-868e-502f-be0c-31b9a23f37c8'}, {'abstract': 'An older man was tormented by a rash that no one could diagnose — until he found a doctor who was known for unlocking difficult cases.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/16/magazine/he-was-unbearably-itchy-but-the-problem-wasnt-in-his-skin.html', 'snippet': 'An older man was tormented by a rash that no one could diagnose — until he found a doctor who was known for unlocking difficult cases.', 'lead_paragraph': '“I feel like my body has been taken over by aliens!” the thin 82-year-old man exclaimed. Dr. Melissa Iammatteo, the chief of allergy and immunology at Westmed Medical Group in Purchase, N.Y., nodded sympathetically. This was her first appointment with the older man, who had come to discuss the itchy rash that had made his life unbearable. At his age, he told the doctor, he’d been through a lot — heart disease, chronic kidney disease, gout — but “this was a whole new ballgame.”', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/20/magazine/20mag-diagnosis-1/20mag-diagnosis-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/20/magazine/20mag-diagnosis-1/20mag-diagnosis-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/20/magazine/20mag-diagnosis-1/20mag-diagnosis-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/20/magazine/20mag-diagnosis-1/20mag-diagnosis-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1869, 'width': 1868, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': N