 about shrimp? That’s the question we asked Melissa Clark a few months ago, wondering which shrimp we ought to buy for our pla goong, our jambalaya, our favorite pizza. We were worried about the farming practices that brought some shrimp to market, the labor of enslaved people, the diseases, the antibiotics, the pollution. We didn’t know: Should we eat wild shrimp, farmed shrimp, expensive shrimp, inexpensive shrimp?', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/16/dining/15shrimprex2-copy/merlin_162067362_e0db2b77-f221-4f87-bcfe-31b44fcff9d2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/16/dining/15shrimprex2-copy/merlin_162067362_e0db2b77-f221-4f87-bcfe-31b44fcff9d2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/16/dining/15shrimprex2-copy/merlin_162067362_e0db2b77-f221-4f87-bcfe-31b44fcff9d2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/16/dining/15shrimprex2-copy/merlin_162067362_e0db2b77-f221-4f87-bcfe-31b44fcff9d2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/16/dining/15shrimprex2-copy/15shrimprex2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/10/16/dining/15shrimprex2-copy/15shrimprex2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, '