on, as a risk because he was so unprepared for his job.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/16/us/politics/gordon-sondland-intelligence-risk.html', 'snippet': 'A former top White House adviser viewed Mr. Sondland, a Trump donor and the ambassador to the European Union, as a risk because he was so unprepared for his job.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — A former top White House foreign policy adviser told House impeachment investigators this week that she viewed Gordon D. Sondland, the United States ambassador to the European Union, as a potential national security risk because he was so unprepared for his job, according to two people familiar with her private testimony.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/16/us/politics/16dc-sondland1/merlin_162381555_e180ed42-d89a-4e76-85eb-fa272e3beabc-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/16/us/politics/16dc-sondland1/merlin_162381555_e180ed42-d89a-4e76-85eb-fa272e3beabc-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/16/us/politics/16dc-sondland1/merlin_162381555_e180ed42-d89a-4e76-85eb-fa272e3beabc-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/16/us/politics/16dc-sondland1/merlin_162381555_e180ed42-d89a-4e76-85eb-fa272e3beabc-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/16/us/politics/16dc-sondland1/16dc-sondland1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'widt