, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8e00677a-eaf1-5652-b692-a210eb52e5b7', 'word_count': 902, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8e00677a-eaf1-5652-b692-a210eb52e5b7'}, {'abstract': 'Big moves come with hitches. But that’s no reason not to go big and bold.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/16/opinion/democrats-2020.html', 'snippet': 'Big moves come with hitches. But that’s no reason not to go big and bold.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I am not one of the nervous Nellies who believe that Democratic candidates shouldn’t dream big and pitch big, transformational ideas. I’m not one of those who believe that Democrats should negotiate with themselves, in advance of submitting a proposal, so that they present only incremental half measures in the name of practicality and perceived ability to implement.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/16/opinion/16blow1/merlin_162774078_0838d6b7-d573-478c-8111-7dad84f727ad-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/16/opinion/16blow1/merlin_162774078_0838d6b7-d573-478c-8111-7dad84f727ad-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/16/opinion/16blow1/merlin_162774078_0838d6b7-d573-478c-8111-7dad84f727ad-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/16/opinion/16blow1/merlin_162774078_0838d6b7-d573-478c-8111-7dad84f727ad-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/16/