rs, Attempted Murders and Homicides', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Brownsville (Brooklyn, NY)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pagan, Jason (d 2019)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-10-17T04:41:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ashley Southall', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ashley', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Southall', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/40a8e706-897b-5509-9fd1-15dbf160bebf', 'word_count': 1050, 'uri': 'nyt://article/40a8e706-897b-5509-9fd1-15dbf160bebf'}, {'abstract': 'A recent documentary about Toni Morrison hits Hulu. And a Hitchcockian thriller with Sam Worthington is on Netflix.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/17/arts/television/whats-on-tv-thursday-a-toni-morrison-doc-and-fractured.html', 'snippet': 'A recent documentary about Toni Morrison hits Hulu. And a Hitchcockian thriller with Sam Worthington is on Netflix.', 'lead_paragraph': 'TONI MORRISON: THE PIECES I AM (2019) Stream on Hulu; Rent on Amazon, Google Play, iTunes, Vudu and YouTube. When her novel “Paradise” was banned in Texas prisons in the 1990s because of the perception that the book had been written to disrupt prison life and could potentially cause strikes or riots,  Toni Morrison had a response that the authorities likely didn’t anticipate. Morrison recalls in this documentary: “I thought, ‘How powerful is that?’” A lengthy interview with Morrison is the ballast of this movie about her, which steers away from telling a typical, straight-ahead story of Morrison’s life and instead offers a kind of meditation on the significance of her work. That is achieved through interviews with, in addition to Morrison, figures like Oprah Winfrey, Angela Davis, Fran Lebowitz, Sonia Sanchez and Robert Gottlieb. “If you want a thorough documentation of everything Morrison has done and everyone she knows, there’s always Wikipedia,” A.O. Scott wrote in his review for The New York Times. “But if you’d prefer an argument for her importance and a sense of her presence, then you won’t be disappointed.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/17/arts/17tvcol-tonimorrison/merlin_156497136_66be45e5-1059-424d-9d8b-7b3b8119f9cc-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/17/arts/17tvcol-tonimorrison/merlin_156497136_66be45e5-1059-424d-9d8b-7b3b8119f9cc-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/17/arts/17tvcol-tonimorrison/merlin_156497136_66be45e5-1059-424d-9d8b-7b3b8119f9cc-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/17/arts/17tvcol-tonimorrison/merlin_156497136_66be45e5-1059-424d-9d8b-7b3b8119f9cc-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 999, 'width': 1499, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/17/arts/17tvcol-tonimorrison/17tvcol-tonimorrison-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/10/17/arts/17tvcol-tonimorrison/17tvcol-tonimorrison-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/17/arts/17tvcol-tonimorris