ppet': 'The Yankees failed to come up with crucial hits against Zack Greinke and the Astros’ relievers, and Houston took a commanding three-games-to-one lead in the series.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Gary Sanchez returned to the dugout to a rain of boos after striking out with the bases loaded. Edwin Encarnacion stared off at nothing in the dugout after producing the same result. Even Gleyber Torres looked to the ground after doing the same. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/17/sports/17alcs-live-3/merlin_162881394_ea0bcf63-f1b6-4281-bfd1-91367b19faa0-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/17/sports/17alcs-live-3/merlin_162881394_ea0bcf63-f1b6-4281-bfd1-91367b19faa0-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/17/sports/17alcs-live-3/merlin_162881394_ea0bcf63-f1b6-4281-bfd1-91367b19faa0-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/17/sports/17alcs-live-3/merlin_162881394_ea0bcf63-f1b6-4281-bfd1-91367b19faa0-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/17/sports/17alcs-live-3/merlin_162881394_ea0bcf63-f1b6-4281-bfd1-91367b19faa0-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/10/17/sports/17alcs-live-3/merlin_162881394_ea0bcf63-f1b6-4281-bfd1-91367b19faa0-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/17/sports/17alcs-live-3/merlin_162881394_ea0bcf63-f1b6-4281-bfd1-91367b19faa0-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'How the Astros Beat the Yankees in Game 4 of the A.L.C.S.', 'kicker': 'Astros 8, Yankees 3', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'For the Yankees, the Door Is Swinging Shut', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Houston Astros', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Yankees', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tanaka, Masahiro', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Greinke, Zack', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Playoff Games', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-10-17T18:01:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By James Wagner and Benjamin Hoffman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'James', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Wagner', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Benjamin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hoffman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f2b820fe-d645-5f5e-bde9-d679ce231ecf', 'word_count': 3730, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f2b820fe-d645-5f5e-bde9-d679ce231ecf'}, {'abstract': 'The best-selling author of “Born to Run” thought he knew almost everything about running. Then he met a donkey named Sherman.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/17/well/move/running-donkey-christopher-mcdougall-born-to-run.html', 'snippet': 'The best-selling author of “Born to Run” thought he knew almost everything about running. Then he met a donkey named Sherman.', 'lead_paragraph': 'We had a sick donkey and a ticking clock, so there wasn’t time to fool around. Our friend Tanya McKean, a horse trainer and veterinary assistant, clicked a rope to the donkey’s halter, then looped it under her butt and swayed way back, using her full body weight to persuade the donkey to place his hoof — just one hoof, just for a second — on the road in front of our house.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/06/11/well/11PETS-SHERMAN1/0611SHERMAN1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/06/11/well/11PETS-SHERMAN1/0611SHERMAN1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/06/11/well/11PETS-SHERMAN1/0611SHERMAN1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/06/11/well/11PETS-SHERMAN1/0611SHERMAN1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/06/11/well/11PETS-SHERMAN1/0611SHERMAN1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/06/11/well/11PETS-SHERMAN1/0611SHERMAN1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/06/11/w