vored E-Cigarettes', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Juul Halts Online Sales of Flavored E-Cigarettes', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'E-Cigarettes', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Smoking and Tobacco', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'E-Commerce', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ADVERTISING AND MARKETING', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Nicotine', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Juul Labs Inc', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Teenagers and Adolescence', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Regulation and Deregulation of Industry', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Crosthwaite, K C', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Food and Drug Administration', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'your-feed-healthcare', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-10-17T18:27:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Science', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sheila Kaplan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sheila', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kaplan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f633d12a-000c-5cce-a8f8-c9c39f964aa9', 'word_count': 925, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f633d12a-000c-5cce-a8f8-c9c39f964aa9'}, {'abstract': 'Teenage comments in response to our recent writing prompts, and an invitation to join the ongoing conversation.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/17/learning/what-students-are-saying-about-pay-for-stay-at-home-parents-getting-an-allowance-and-finding-solace.html', 'snippet': 'Teenage comments in response to our recent writing prompts, and an invitation to join the ongoing conversation.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Our writing prompts often give students a chance to weigh in on the policies, practices and ideas that directly affect teenagers and children. And, whether it’s banned books, free college, active-shooter drills or handling sibling conflicts, we can always count on them to offer invaluable insight.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/09/27/upshot/00up-booker-child-LN/merlin_158995893_af894f7b-35e1-4f18-95ef-07219c1afbca-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/09/27/upshot/00up-booker-child-LN/merlin_158995893_af894f7b-35e1-4f18-95ef-07219c1afbca-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/09/27/upshot/00up-booker-child-LN/merlin_158995893_af894f7b-35e1-4f18-95ef-07219c1afbca-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/09/27/upshot/00up-booker-child-LN/merlin_158995893_af894f7b-35e1-4f18-95ef-07219c1afbca-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/09/27/upshot/00up-booker-child-LN/00up-booker-child-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/09/27/upshot/00up-booker-child-LN/00up-booker-child-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'captio