Carthy1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/10/20/obituaries/20NiCarthy-obit1/17NiCarthy1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/20/obituaries/20NiCarthy-obit1/17NiCarthy1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Ginny NiCarthy, 92, Author of Guide for Battered Women, Dies', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Ginny NiCarthy, 92, Author  Of Self-Help Guide, Is Dead', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'NiCarthy, Ginny', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Domestic Violence', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Women and Girls', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': "Women's Rights", 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Getting Free: You Can End Abuse and Take Back Your Life (Book)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-10-17T22:29:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Obits', 'section_name': 'Books', 'byline': {'original': 'By Anita Gates', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Anita', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gates', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/8a38af60-00c3-591b-acac-8206c4d68c4d', 'word_count': 685, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8a38af60-00c3-591b-acac-8206c4d68c4d'}, {'abstract': 'He was the above-the-fray front-runner a few months ago. Now he’s taking a different tone.', 'web_u