ouses.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Frank Lloyd Wright’s Solomon R. Guggenheim Museum is still a shock on Fifth Avenue. The architecture declines to fade into the background or get old, never mind the building turns 60 this month.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/18/lens/18-guggenheim-ast-02/merlin_100829470_c324166e-575b-48ed-8697-740c812aaf8b-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 397, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/18/lens/18-guggenheim-ast-02/merlin_100829470_c324166e-575b-48ed-8697-740c812aaf8b-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 397}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/18/lens/18-guggenheim-ast-02/merlin_100829470_c324166e-575b-48ed-8697-740c812aaf8b-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 678, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/18/lens/18-guggenheim-ast-02/merlin_100829470_c324166e-575b-48ed-8697-740c812aaf8b-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1356, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/18/lens/18-guggenheim-ast-02/18-guggenheim-ast-02-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/10/18/lens/18-guggenheim-ast-02/18-guggenheim-ast-02-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/18/lens/18-guggenheim-ast-02/18-guggenheim-ast-02-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150