wn men accused him of murder in Afghanistan.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/18/arts/television/leavenworth-review.html', 'snippet': 'A documentary mini-series on Starz examines the case of a platoon leader whose own men accused him of murder in Afghanistan.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If you’re not familiar with the case of First Lt. Clint Lorance, currently serving a 19-year sentence at Fort Leavenworth, Kan., for murder, then you’re probably not a regular Fox News viewer. Court-martialed and jailed in 2013 for the deaths of two unarmed Afghans killed by men under his command, Lorance was later adopted by Sean Hannity and other conservative commentators as a victim of Obama-era political correctness run amok.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/23/arts/18leavenworth/merlin_162824349_b6d52b52-c990-4201-9123-95062bcc09c8-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 391, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/23/arts/18leavenworth/merlin_162824349_b6d52b52-c990-4201-9123-95062bcc09c8-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 391}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/23/arts/18leavenworth/merlin_162824349_b6d52b52-c990-4201-9123-95062bcc09c8-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 667, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/23/arts/18leavenworth/merlin_162824349_b6d52b52-c990-4201-9123-95062bcc09c8-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1122, 'width': 1722, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/23/arts/18leavenworth/merlin_16282434