etary of energy, will be nominated to take over from Mr. Perry, who said he would resign amid scrutiny over his role in the Ukraine scandal.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/18/us/politics/dan-brouillette-energy-secretary-rick-perry.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Brouillette, the deputy secretary of energy, will be nominated to take over from Mr. Perry, who said he would resign amid scrutiny over his role in the Ukraine scandal.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — President Trump said on Friday that he would nominate Dan Brouillette, the deputy secretary of energy, to succeed Rick Perry as energy secretary after the former Texas governor said he would resign amid scrutiny over his role in the Ukraine scandal.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/18/multimedia/18xp-brouillette/merlin_160483212_6296e66b-0e68-4619-a256-02d32265b74b-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/18/multimedia/18xp-brouillette/merlin_160483212_6296e66b-0e68-4619-a256-02d32265b74b-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/18/multimedia/18xp-brouillette/merlin_160483212_6296e66b-0e68-4619-a256-02d32265b74b-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/18/multimedia/18xp-brouillette/merlin_160483212_6296e66b-0e68-4619-a256-02d32265b74b-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/18/multimedia/18xp-brouillette/18xp-brouillette-