rican League juggernauts, and now his name is popping up in M.L.B. manager searches.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/18/sports/joe-espada-manager.html', 'snippet': 'Espada, the 44-year-old bench coach for Houston, has impressed in roles with both American League juggernauts, and now his name is popping up in M.L.B. manager searches.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Before Joe Espada took over as the Yankees’ third base coach in 2015, he spent the 2014 season as a special assistant to General Manager Brian Cashman. The position was ostensibly a pro scouting role, but it also allowed Espada the opportunity to work with the front office and learn the organization’s philosophy — a coaching residency of sorts.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/18/sports/18espada/merlin_162599907_bb57ae5a-fd13-4ce2-80cf-c09b9b3f37a4-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/18/sports/18espada/merlin_162599907_bb57ae5a-fd13-4ce2-80cf-c09b9b3f37a4-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/18/sports/18espada/merlin_162599907_bb57ae5a-fd13-4ce2-80cf-c09b9b3f37a4-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/18/sports/18espada/merlin_162599907_bb57ae5a-fd13-4ce2-80cf-c09b9b3f37a4-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/18/sports/18espada/18espada-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'c