nted death wish” that drove him to drugs and crime, shining a light on his famous family along the way.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/19/books/cameron-douglas-long-way-home.html', 'snippet': 'In his memoir “Long Way Home,” Michael Douglas’s oldest son examines the “demented death wish” that drove him to drugs and crime, shining a light on his famous family along the way.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On the day in 2009 when Cameron Douglas was arrested at a New York hotel for possession of crystal meth, he was given a choice. As he recounts in his memoir, “Long Way Home,” a Drug Enforcement Administration agent told him he could either be taken out the front door, kicking and screaming, or, “for your family’s sake, we can take you out the back way, put you in a car.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/19/books/19Douglas1/merlin_162773226_2845e451-d78e-4e85-a2c3-cd3801d2d345-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 800, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/19/books/19Douglas1/merlin_162773226_2845e451-d78e-4e85-a2c3-cd3801d2d345-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 800}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/19/books/19Douglas1/merlin_162773226_2845e451-d78e-4e85-a2c3-cd3801d2d345-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 768, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/19/books/19Douglas1/merlin_162773226_2845e451-d78e-4e85-a2c3-cd3801d2d345-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1536, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'ima