ard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/20/multimedia/20xp-lakebody-print1/00xp-skeleton-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Hikers Find Mystery Skeleton on Remote Mountain in California', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Hikers Find a Mystery Skeleton in a Remote Part of a Mountain in California', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Skeletons', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Mount Williamson (Calif)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'DNA (Deoxyribonucleic Acid)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hikes and Hiking', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mountaineering', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-10-19T09:30:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Express', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Heather Murphy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Heather', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Murphy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/71a2a97b-5c1b-5ff0-b92f-4a5756e9451d', 'word_count': 923, 'uri': 'nyt://article/71a2a97b-5c1b-5ff0-b92f-4a5756e9451d'}, {'abstract': 'It took a woman to break the spell that appeared to put the president above the law.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/19/opinion/marie-yovanovitchs-moral-courage.html', 'snippet': 'It took a woman to break the spell that appeared to put the president above the law.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Like many Americans, I watched with relief and gratitude as Marie Yovanovitch, the former United States Ambassador to Ukraine, marched through a throng of reporters on Oct. 11 to testify to Congress. Her defiance of a State Department order not to testify was an example of moral courage we have seldom seen among those who have worked for or supported the Trump administration. It was as if the nation had been under a spell, and Yovanovitch broke it. Since then, former and current members of the Trump administration have continued to come forward. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/21/opinion/21stoneWeb/merlin_162556503_9499deed-ee10-4898-a8c7-a79ce4b8d7e5-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/21/opinion/21stoneWeb/merlin_162556503_9499deed-ee10-4898-a8c7-a79ce4b8d7e5-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/21/opinion/21stoneWeb/merlin_162556503_9499deed-ee10-4898-a8c7-a79ce4b8d7e5-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/21/opinion/21stoneWeb/merlin_162556503_9499deed-ee10-4898-a8c7-a79ce4b8d7e5-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/21/opinion/21stoneWeb/21stoneWeb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/10/21/opinion/21stoneWeb/21stoneWeb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/21/opinion/21stoneWeb/21stoneWeb-thumbLar