resident Trump, died at 68. Let’s dive right in.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What Happened in the Impeachment Inquiry This Week?', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Trump-Ukraine Whistle-blower Complaint and Impeachment Inquiry', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Impeachment', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Foreign Aid', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Giuliani, Rudolph W', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mattis, James N', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sondland, Gordon D (1957- )', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-10-19T11:33:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kaly Soto', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kaly', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Soto', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6b99df6a-7e32-5f11-8b90-c6b5c00be9d9', 'word_count': 864, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6b99df6a-7e32-5f11-8b90-c6b5c00be9d9'}, {'abstract': 'It turns out that it is not much different than running with a stubborn dog, only they’re a lot bigger and can break your leg.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/19/well/move/running-with-donkeys.html', 'snippet': 'It turns out that it is not much different than running with a stubborn dog, only they’re a lot bigger and can break your leg.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Welcome to the