', 'word_count': 1365, 'uri': 'nyt://article/81d36ac8-156e-5235-ba59-e2bd31ba0a04'}, {'abstract': 'The president is unabashed, unapologetic and out of control.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/19/opinion/sunday/donald-trump-united-states.html', 'snippet': 'The president is unabashed, unapologetic and out of control.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The wonder of the Trump administration — the jaw-dropping, brain-exploding phantasmagoria of it — is that it doesn’t bury its rottenness under layers of counterfeit virtue or use a honeyed voice to mask the vinegar inside. The rottenness is out in the open. The sourness is right there on the surface for all to see.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/20/opinion/sunday/20bruni/20bruni-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 542, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/20/opinion/sunday/20bruni/20bruni-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 542}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/20/opinion/sunday/20bruni/20bruni-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 925, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/20/opinion/sunday/20bruni/20bruni-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1849, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/20/opinion/sunday/20bruni/20bruni-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/10/20/opinion/sunday/20bruni/20bruni-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailhe