met at a holiday party in Washington in 2016, and had their first date the following weekend', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/20/fashion/weddings/joshua-ghaffari-mark-tyndall.html', 'snippet': 'The couple met at a holiday party in Washington in 2016, and had their first date the following weekend', 'lead_paragraph': 'Joshua Javid Ghaffari and Mark Anthony Tyndall were married Oct. 19 in Washington. Sharon H. Yuan, a friend of the couple who was authorized as a temporary marriage officiant by the Superior Court of the District of Columbia, officiated at President Lincoln’s Cottage.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/20/fashion/weddings/20GHAFFARI/20GHAFFARI-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 354, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/20/fashion/weddings/20GHAFFARI/20GHAFFARI-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 354}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/20/fashion/weddings/20GHAFFARI/20GHAFFARI-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 605, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/20/fashion/weddings/20GHAFFARI/20GHAFFARI-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1210, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/20/fashion/weddings/20GHAFFARI/20GHAFFARI-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/10/20/fashion/weddings/20GHAFFARI/20GHAFFARI-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/20/fashion/weddings/20GHAFFARI/20GHAFFARI-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Joshua Ghaffari, Mark Tyndall', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Joshua Ghaffari,  Mark Tyndall', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Weddings and Engagements', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-10-20T04:15:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Society', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'subsection_name': 'Weddings', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a6442585-6eeb-5ba9-9601-9e10d9dbfc70', 'word_count': 205, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a6442585-6eeb-5ba9-9601-9e10d9dbfc70'}, {'abstract': 'Damon Lindelof’s take on the comic book series airs on HBO. And Jessica Biel stars in a new sci-fi thriller based on a fiction podcast.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/20/arts/television/whats-on-tv-sunday-watchmen-and-limetown.html', 'snippet': 'Damon Lindelof’s take on the comic book series airs on HBO. And Jessica Biel stars in a new sci-fi thriller based on a fiction podcast.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WATCHMEN 9 p.m. on HBO. When the 12-part comic book series “Watchmen” came out in 1986 and 1987, it upended the traditional idea of what a superhero could be. In looking back at that comic for The New York Times, Adam Sternbergh wrote that “Watchmen” “felt entirely new, given it meant considering heroes as fallible and complex humans, prone to the array of ugly and shameful emotions recognizable from the real world.” Now, with superhero stories dominating the box office, this new series from the “Lost” and “The Leftovers” creator Damon Lindelof offers a new take on that comic, trading the original’s Cold War themes for those of white supremacy. Regina King stars as Angela Abar, who works with the police as her masked alter ego, Sister Night, while Jeremy Irons and Jean Smart play older versions of original “Watchmen” characters Adrian Veidt and Laurie Juspeczyk. ', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/20/arts/20tvcol-watchmen/20tvcol-watchmen-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/20/arts/20tvcol-watchmen/20tvcol-watchmen-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/20/arts/20tvcol-watchmen/20tvcol-watchmen-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/20/arts/20tvcol-watchmen/20tvcol-watchmen-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/20/arts/20tvcol-watchmen/20tvcol-watchmen-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/10/20/arts/20tvcol-watchmen/20tvcol-watchmen-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/20/arts/20tvcol-watchmen/20tvcol-watchmen-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'What’s on TV Sunday: ‘Watchmen’ and ‘Limetown’', 'kicker': None, 'content_k