7809', 'word_count': 95, 'uri': 'nyt://article/45053a00-863c-582d-ac9b-0a83b1527809'}, {'abstract': 'The men behind the Dead Rabbit bar have organized a festival for the spirit at Pier A.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/21/dining/irish-whiskey-festival-new-york.html', 'snippet': 'The men behind the Dead Rabbit bar have organized a festival for the spirit at Pier A.', 'lead_paragraph': 'An event billed as the first Irish whiskey festival in New York will take place on Nov. 2 at Pier A Harbor House, featuring tastings, cocktails, seminars, food and music. It’s organized by Sean Muldoon and Jack McGarry, partners in the award-winning bar, the Dead Rabbit, along with Articulate Ventures, an event organizer. Tickets are available for afternoon or evening sessions. Regular admission includes whiskey tastings, with food and a souvenir glass; V.I.P. ticket holders get to visit the Dead Rabbit pop-up and sample special cocktails and oysters.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/23/dining/21burner2/merlin_162393042_c2eb20dd-c889-4ac4-bb55-36ce809de68f-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 392, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/23/dining/21burner2/merlin_162393042_c2eb20dd-c889-4ac4-bb55-36ce809de68f-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 392}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/23/dining/21burner2/merlin_162393042_c2eb20dd-c889-4ac4-bb55-36ce809de68f-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 669, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/23/dining/21burner2/merlin_162393042_c2eb20dd-c889-4ac4-bb55-36ce809de68f-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1337, 'wi