ers', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Jets', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New England Patriots', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Darnold, Sam (1997- )', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brady, Tom', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-10-22T04:28:58+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bill Pennington', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bill', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pennington', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/dc514dc0-1ec8-59c8-8386-43b5332d215f', 'word_count': 826, 'uri': 'nyt://article/dc514dc0-1ec8-59c8-8386-43b5332d215f'}, {'abstract': 'The Washington Nationals kick off Game 1 against the Houston Astros, and the comedian Jenny Slate conquers her stage fright in a new Netflix special.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/22/arts/television/whats-on-tv-tuesday-world-series-jenny-slate.html', 'snippet': 'The Washington Nationals kick off Game 1 against the Houston Astros, and the comedian Jenny Slate conquers her stage fright in a new Netflix special.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WORLD SERIES 8 p.m. on Fox. The Washington Nationals swept their way to their first World Series, beating the St. Louis Cardinals in four games in what has become somewhat of a Cinderella story for the franchise. The team lost one of the league’s most dynamic players, Bryce Harper, before the season, and then its manager, Dave Martinez, had a heart procedure last month. Despite those setbacks, the Nationals went on to become the National League wild card, and secured D.C.’s first World Series in 86 years following outstanding performances against the Los Angeles Dodgers and the Cardinals. Now the series rookies will take on the Houston Astros, who beat the New York Yankees in six games to win the American League championship. Game 1 is at Minute Maid Park in Houston. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/22/arts/22tvcol-nationals/22tvcol-nationals-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/22/arts/22tvcol-nationals/22tvcol-nationals-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/22/arts/22tvcol-nationals/22tvcol-nationals-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/22/arts/22tvcol-nationals/22tvcol-nationals-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/22/arts/22tvcol-nationals/22tvcol-nationals-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/10/22/arts/22tvcol-nationals/22tvcol-nationals-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/22/arts/22tvcol-nationals/22tvcol-nationals-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'What’s on TV Tuesday: The World Series and Jenny Slate’s Comedy Spec