 Houston and Washington. But the theme of this Fall Classic is clear: Two groups of dominant, durable starters will be going toe-to-toe on the mound.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/22/sports/baseball/world-series-astros-nationals.html', 'snippet': 'Sure, there are offensive stars in Houston and Washington. But the theme of this Fall Classic is clear: Two groups of dominant, durable starters will be going toe-to-toe on the mound.', 'lead_paragraph': 'HOUSTON — There is no stage in sports quite like it. In football and basketball and hockey, in boxing and tennis and soccer, every competitor stands on a level playing surface. Not so in baseball, where one performer starts the action from a raised circle in the center of it all.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/21/sports/21kepnerpreview-top/merlin_162719175_2443f802-2c9c-4205-b81f-8f3417c5c0d2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/21/sports/21kepnerpreview-top/merlin_162719175_2443f802-2c9c-4205-b81f-8f3417c5c0d2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/21/sports/21kepnerpreview-top/merlin_162719175_2443f802-2c9c-4205-b81f-8f3417c5c0d2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/21/sports/21kepnerpreview-top/merlin_162719175_2443f802-2c9c-4205-b81f-8f3417c5c0d2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url':