sts were killed each day in traffic crashes in 2018. Distracted drivers and bigger vehicles may be the culprits, experts say.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/22/us/pedestrian-cyclist-deaths-traffic.html', 'snippet': 'On average, 17 pedestrians and two cyclists were killed each day in traffic crashes in 2018. Distracted drivers and bigger vehicles may be the culprits, experts say.', 'lead_paragraph': 'More pedestrians and cyclists were killed last year in the United States than in any year since 1990, according to a report released on Tuesday by the National Highway Traffic Safety Administration.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/22/us/22pedestrians/merlin_162087903_b326266c-1305-41d3-a71a-df2fb80b60fa-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/22/us/22pedestrians/merlin_162087903_b326266c-1305-41d3-a71a-df2fb80b60fa-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/22/us/22pedestrians/merlin_162087903_b326266c-1305-41d3-a71a-df2fb80b60fa-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/22/us/22pedestrians/merlin_162087903_b326266c-1305-41d3-a71a-df2fb80b60fa-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/22/us/22pedestrians/22pedestrians-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnai