cer.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/23/magazine/stock-car-announcer-racing.html', 'snippet': 'The life and times of a stock-car-racing announcer.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The first race was still three hours away, yet knots of fans were already lounging in the shade outside the gates on portable furniture, preparing high-cholesterol food beside their pickups, refueling for the long night of action. The sun was shining on a late-summer afternoon. The big trailers were rumbling in, towing the decaled racecars — the ones that resemble giant wedges, speeding doorstops. The air was redolent of grease and the unmistakable smell of a clay racetrack.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '48', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/27/magazine/27mag-racecar/27mag-racecar-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 750, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/27/magazine/27mag-racecar/27mag-racecar-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 750}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/27/magazine/27mag-racecar/27mag-racecar-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 820, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/27/magazine/27mag-racecar/27mag-racecar-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1639, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/27/magazine/27mag-racecar/27mag-racecar-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/10/27/magazine/27mag-racecar/27mag-racecar-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thu