'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/23/arts/television/chuck-lorre-kominsky-method-netflix.html', 'snippet': 'Ahead of the Season 2 premiere of his Golden Globe-winning Netflix series, the man synonymous with network sitcoms discusses the challenges of trying something new.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Chuck Lorre has been called the “angriest man on TV” because of his battles with network executives, actors and critics. He has also been called the “King of Comedy,” having created one hit network sitcom after another since the early ’90s. One title he has only recently grown accustomed to, however, is “old.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/23/arts/23lorre-1/23lorre-1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/23/arts/23lorre-1/23lorre-1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/23/arts/23lorre-1/23lorre-1-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/23/arts/23lorre-1/23lorre-1-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/23/arts/23lorre-1/23lorre-1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/10/23/arts/23lorre-1/23lorre-1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/2