gs like tofu were out. And the more sweet potatoes he could serve up, the better.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/05/science/23TB-RAWFOOD/merlin_116992307_c5ca87a4-2db5-420c-8003-82cf4cdcc600-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 401, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/11/05/science/23TB-RAWFOOD/merlin_116992307_c5ca87a4-2db5-420c-8003-82cf4cdcc600-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 401}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/05/science/23TB-RAWFOOD/merlin_116992307_c5ca87a4-2db5-420c-8003-82cf4cdcc600-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 684, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/05/science/23TB-RAWFOOD/merlin_116992307_c5ca87a4-2db5-420c-8003-82cf4cdcc600-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/05/science/23TB-RAWFOOD/23TB-RAWFOOD-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/11/05/science/23TB-RAWFOOD/23TB-RAWFOOD-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/05/science/23TB-RAWFOOD/23TB-RAWFOOD-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'When the Menu Turns Raw, Your Gut Microbes Know What to Do', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_he