 prime minister challenged lawmakers to approve a general election, but the opposition Labour Party reacted coolly to the idea.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — Prime Minister Boris Johnson, stymied by Parliament on his plan to leave the European Union by the end of the month, challenged lawmakers on Thursday to approve a general election in December, hoping to win a popular mandate to carry out his vision of a swift Brexit.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Boris Johnson Calls for December Election in Push to Break Brexit Deadlock', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Johnson Calls for an Election on Dec. 12. But Only Parliament Can Call One.', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Great Britain Withdrawal from EU (Brexit)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Johnson, Boris', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Great Britain', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'European Union', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Legislatures and Parliaments', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Politics and Government', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-10-24T16:26:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Stephen Castle and Mark Landler', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Stephen', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Castle', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Mark', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Landler', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d411dc20-f0d5-58bf-94d1-57a2ecbbd6f0', 'word_count': 1206, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d411dc20-f0d5-58bf-94d1-57a2ecbbd6f0'}, {'abstract': 'He began giving out the award later in his presidency than his predecessors, but is doing so with increasing frequency.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/24/us/politics/trumps-medal-freedom.html', 'snippet': 'He began giving out the award later in his presidency than his predecessors, but is doing so with increasing frequency.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — President Trump enjoys a unilateral executive move. For trade negotiations, he has tariffs. For several of his political allies, he has pardons. And for a growing number of athletes, donors and assorted Friends of the White House, he has the Presidential Medal of Freedom. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/24/us/politics/24dc-memo-sub/merlin_163257816_9bcaede4-c8d8-4767-81f4-002cccd8762f-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 363, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/24/us/politics/24dc-memo-sub/merlin_163257816_9bcaede4-c8d8-4767-81f4-002cccd8762f-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 363}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/24/us/politics/24dc-memo-sub/merlin_163257816_9bcaede4-c8d8-4767-81f4-002cccd8762f-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 620, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/24/us/politics/24dc-memo-sub/merlin_163257816_9bcaede4-c8d8-4767-81f4-002cccd8762f-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1239, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/24/us/politics/24dc-memo-sub/24dc-memo-sub-thumbSt