i': 'nyt://article/93b0743a-72a2-52c6-851d-3b72176beeb5'}, {'abstract': 'President Trump wants his party to defend him more aggressively. Senators instead are denouncing the House investigation.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/24/us/politics/trump-republicans-impeachment.html', 'snippet': 'President Trump wants his party to defend him more aggressively. Senators instead are denouncing the House investigation.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Republicans in Congress struggled for a second consecutive day Thursday to defend President Trump against Democrats’ impeachment inquiry amid a steady stream of damaging revelations about his conduct, leveling another symbolic objection to a process they said was fundamentally unfair.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/24/us/politics/24dc-impeach-sub/24dc-impeach-sub-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/24/us/politics/24dc-impeach-sub/24dc-impeach-sub-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/24/us/politics/24dc-impeach-sub/24dc-impeach-sub-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/24/us/politics/24dc-impeach-sub/24dc-impeach-sub-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/24/us/politics/24dc-impeach-sub/24dc-impeach-sub-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop