'word_count': 47, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7427baf6-c19c-5bcd-8000-03497dcc1fcb'}, {'abstract': 'Blackjewel went bankrupt in July and about 1,100 workers in central Appalachia lost several weeks of pay. In protest, coal miners blocked a train full of coal for months.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/24/us/blackjewel-coal-miners.html', 'snippet': 'Blackjewel went bankrupt in July and about 1,100 workers in central Appalachia lost several weeks of pay. In protest, coal miners blocked a train full of coal for months.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For two months this summer, out-of-work miners blocked a train full of coal from shipping out of an eastern Kentucky mine, demanding weeks of unpaid wages after their employer, Blackjewel, suddenly went bankrupt.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/24/multimedia/24xp-miners/merlin_159358989_e3cd5f18-ea4e-4429-888d-a0618df1c3c5-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/24/multimedia/24xp-miners/merlin_159358989_e3cd5f18-ea4e-4429-888d-a0618df1c3c5-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/24/multimedia/24xp-miners/merlin_159358989_e3cd5f18-ea4e-4429-888d-a0618df1c3c5-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 684, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/24/multimedia/24xp-miners/merlin_159358989_e3cd5f18-ea4e-4429-888d-a0618df1c3c5-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/24/multimedia/24xp-miners/