acks (Rugby Team)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Springboks (Rugby Team)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-10-25T05:00:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Joe Ritchie', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Joe', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ritchie', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/76af8499-0ee2-59fe-bb68-2127e42fb1c6', 'word_count': 817, 'uri': 'nyt://article/76af8499-0ee2-59fe-bb68-2127e42fb1c6'}, {'abstract': 'A new biopic with Eddie Murphy hits Netflix. And “Maleficent” airs on TNT as its sequel plays in theaters.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/25/arts/television/whats-on-tv-friday-dolemite-is-my-name-and-maleficent.html', 'snippet': 'A new biopic with Eddie Murphy hits Netflix. And “Maleficent” airs on TNT as its sequel plays in theaters.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DOLEMITE IS MY NAME (2019) Stream on Netflix. Eddie Murphy wears vivid suits and tilted hats and carries a weighty cane in this new biopic. The film casts Murphy as the comedian Rudy Ray Moore, who at the crest of the blaxploitation era self-financed “Dolemite,” a 1975 crime action movie in which he starred as a pimp out for revenge. The original movie became a cult hit. (A typical scene involves an F.B.I. agent being kicked into the trunk of a Cadillac.) The biopic charts the lead-up to and the making of that movie, with the help of an all-star cast: Tituss Burgess, Keegan-Michael Key, Da’Vine Joy Randolph, Craig Robinson and Wesley Snipes play some of Moore’s associates, and Snoop Dogg and Chris Rock each make cameos. The movie has a “loose, friendly, house-party vibe,” A.O. Scott wrote in his review for The New York Times, and is intended as a comeback vehicle for Murphy. “I didn’t want to just pop back up,” he said in a recent interview with The Times. “I wanted a funny movie to remind them that they liked me. This movie turned out so strong that I figured this is a great way to come back.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/25/arts/25tvcol-dolemite/merlin_161549331_ed7679bc-7847-413b-94c6-7ef4425ced4f-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/25/arts/25tvcol-dolemite/merlin_161549331_ed7679bc-7847-413b-94c6-7ef4425ced4f-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/25/arts/25tvcol-dolemite/merlin_161549331_ed7679bc-7847-413b-94c6-7ef4425ced4f-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/25/arts/25tvcol-dolemite/merlin_161549331_ed7679bc-7847-413b-94c6-7ef4425ced4f-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/25/arts/25tvcol-dolemite/25tvcol-dolemite-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/10/25/arts/25tvcol-dolemite/25tvcol-dolemite-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/25/arts/25tvcol-dolemite/25tvcol-dolemite-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'What’s on TV Friday: ‘Dol