team or interfere with decision-making when a patient is in cardiac arrest.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On one recent intensive care unit shift, I admitted a man whose heart had stopped earlier that day. By the time I met him, it seemed clear that he wasn’t going to live. So when he went into cardiac arrest for what I suspected would be the last time, I headed out of the unit to find his wife.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/29/smarter-living/00well_doctors_icu/00well_doctors_icu-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 406, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/29/smarter-living/00well_doctors_icu/00well_doctors_icu-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 406}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/29/smarter-living/00well_doctors_icu/00well_doctors_icu-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 693, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/29/smarter-living/00well_doctors_icu/00well_doctors_icu-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2018, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/29/smarter-living/00well_doctors_icu/00well_doctors_icu-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/10/29/smarter-living/00well_doctors_icu/00well_doctors_icu-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/29/smarter-living/00well_doctors_icu/00well_doctors_icu-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Should Family Members See Patients Die in the I.C.U.?', 'kicker': 'Doctors', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Code Blue: Let the Family Stay?', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cardiopulmonary Resuscitation (CPR)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Medicine and Health', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-10-25T09:00:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Well', 'section_name': 'Well', 'subsection_name': 'Live', 'byline': {'original': 'By Daniela J. Lamas, M.D', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Daniela', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': 'Lamas', 'qualifier': 'M.D', 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/84b3303a-9a94-58c9-a0eb-83064c063eb7', 'word_count': 1096, 'uri': 'nyt://article/84b3303a-9a94-58c9-a0eb-83064c063eb7'}, {'abstract': 'Holly George-Warren’s “Janis” follows the singer from her painful early years in a conservative Texas oil town to the fame she achieved with her powerful and unusual voice.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/25/books/review-janis-joplin-biography-holly-george-warren.html', 'snippet': 'Holly George-Warren’s “Janis” follows the singer from her painful early years in a conservative Texas oil town to the fame she achieved with her powerful and unusual voice.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Had she not died at 27 of an accidental heroin overdose, Janis Joplin would be 76 — two years younger than Paul Simon and four years younger than Mavis Staples. Singers with scorched voices sometimes settle more deeply into them. (Have you heard the most recent Marianne Faithfull album?) One wonders at the body of recordings Joplin might have made.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/24/us/24bookgeorge-warren-promo/merlin_28981295_8ff865ee-b12d-4f0d-b08e-b0ca17f7147e-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 404, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/11/24/us/24bookgeorge-warren-promo/merlin_28981295_8ff865ee-b12d-4f0d-b08e-b0ca17f7147e-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 404}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/24/us/24bookgeorge-warren-promo/merlin_28981295_8ff865ee-b12d-4f0d-b08e-b0ca17f7147e-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 690, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/24/us/24bookgeorge-warren-promo/merlin_28981295_8ff865ee-b12d-4f0d-b08e-b0ca17f7147e-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1379, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/24/us/24bookgeorge-warren-promo/merlin_28981295_8ff865ee-b12d-4f0d-b08e-b0ca17f7147e-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/11/24/us/24bookgeorge-warren-promo/merlin_28981295_8ff865ee-b12d-4f0d-b08e-b0ca17f7147e-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/24/us/24bookgeorge-warren-promo/merlin_28981295_8ff865ee-b12d-4f0d-b08e-b0ca17f7147e-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A New Biography of Janis Joplin Captures the Pain and Soul of an A