earlier mission with Army Rangers in Afghanistan, and was scheduled to try out for the elite Delta Force in West Virginia after returning home. But now, lying on the ground, his mission that night as part of a small C.I.A. Omega Team leading Afghan commandos was over — and maybe his military career as well.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/23/magazine/00atwar-Jeffery-Dawson/00atwar-Jeffery-Dawson-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 839, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/23/magazine/00atwar-Jeffery-Dawson/00atwar-Jeffery-Dawson-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 839}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/23/magazine/00atwar-Jeffery-Dawson/00atwar-Jeffery-Dawson-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 733, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/23/magazine/00atwar-Jeffery-Dawson/00atwar-Jeffery-Dawson-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1119, 'width': 800, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/23/magazine/00atwar-Jeffery-Dawson/00atwar-Jeffery-Dawson-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/10/23/magazine/00atwar-Jeffery-Dawson/00atwar-Jeffery-Dawson-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/23/magazine/00atwar-Jeffery-Dawson/00atwar-Jeffery-Dawson-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 