_paragraph': 'LONDON — Prime Minister Boris Johnson says he will not do business with Parliament until the opposition Labour Party agrees to a general election. Labour says it will not agree to an election until the European Union decides how long an extension to grant Britain to leave. And European leaders say they will not make that decision until the deadlock in London is broken.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/25/world/25brexit/merlin_163285239_b07bcb4a-acdf-4ce1-84cb-52a17140d718-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/25/world/25brexit/merlin_163285239_b07bcb4a-acdf-4ce1-84cb-52a17140d718-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/25/world/25brexit/merlin_163285239_b07bcb4a-acdf-4ce1-84cb-52a17140d718-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/25/world/25brexit/merlin_163285239_b07bcb4a-acdf-4ce1-84cb-52a17140d718-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/25/world/25brexit/25brexit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/10/25/world/25brexit/25brexit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/25/world/25brexit/25brexit-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Brexit Logjam, in Three Dimensions', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In Brexit Logjam, the Three Players Try to See Who Blinks First', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Great Britain Withdrawal from EU (Brexit)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Cardiff University', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Conservative Party (Great Britain)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'European Union', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Labour Party (Great Britain)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Corbyn, Jeremy (1949- )', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Johnson, Boris', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Brussels (Belgium)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'London (England)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-10-25T17:30:58+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mark Landler and Stephen Castle', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mark', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Landler', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Stephen', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Castle', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c6875e63-aaad-55e6-91fa-b31929aadc9e', 'word_count': 1147, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c6875e63-aaad-55e6-91fa-b31929aadc9e'}, {'abstract': 'She worked closely with her husband, the composer Gyorgy Kurtag, as a performer, muse and critic and was also deeply involved in his writing.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/25/arts/music/marta-kurtag-dead.html', 'snippet': 'She worked closely with her husband, the composer Gyorgy Kurtag, as a performer, muse and critic and was also deeply involved in his writing.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Marta Kurtag, a pianist and teacher who shared a 72-year collaboration with her husband, the prominent avant-garde composer Gyorgy Kurtag, profoundly influencing his work and joining him in dual recitals that acquired a legendary reputation in their later years, died on Oct. 17 in Budapest. She was 92.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/28/obituaries/24Kurtag1/merlin_145217154_0b626329-df15-4c85-9440-953b6120a919-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/28/obituaries/24Kurtag1/merlin_145217154_0b626329-df15-4c85-9440-953b6120a919-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/28/obituaries/24Kurtag1/merlin_145217154_0b626329-df15-4c85-9440-953b6120a919-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/28/obituaries/24Kurtag1/merlin_145217154_0b626329-df15-4c85-9440-953b6120a919-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/28/obituaries/24Kurtag1/24Kurtag1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/10/28/obituaries/24Kur