 New York Portfolio Review, which is produced by The New York Times photo department, the Craig Newmark Graduate School of Journalism at the City University of New York and United Photo Industries. Participation is open to anyone over 18 years old, and all types of photography will be considered. The deadline is Tuesday November 19, 11:59 p.m. Eastern Time. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/29/lens/lens-portfolio-review/lens-portfolio-review-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 625, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/29/lens/lens-portfolio-review/lens-portfolio-review-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 625}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/29/lens/lens-portfolio-review/lens-portfolio-review-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 983, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/29/lens/lens-portfolio-review/lens-portfolio-review-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1966, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/29/lens/lens-portfolio-review/lens-portfolio-review-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/10/29/lens/lens-portfolio-review/lens-portfolio-review-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/29/lens/lens-portfolio-review/lens-portfolio-review-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarg