es. The board president recently said nothing could be done. But the bar is a tenant of the co-op. Doesn’t the board have a say over its tenant’s behavior?', 'print_section': 'RE', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/27/realestate/26Ask/26Ask-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 118, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/27/realestate/26Ask/26Ask-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 118}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/27/realestate/26Ask/26Ask-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 201, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/27/realestate/26Ask/26Ask-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 402, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/27/realestate/26Ask/26Ask-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/10/27/realestate/26Ask/26Ask-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/27/realestate/26Ask/26Ask-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Noise Complaint: The Bar Downstairs Blasts Music All Night!', 'kicker': 'Ask Real Estate', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'When the Bar Downstairs  Really Cranks Up the Volume', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Real