ocations', 'value': 'California', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Los Angeles (Calif)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-10-28T14:29:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Express', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Basketball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Niraj Chokshi', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Niraj', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Chokshi', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/10ef7f23-2225-5f34-8573-3150eaf0ae8b', 'word_count': 338, 'uri': 'nyt://article/10ef7f23-2225-5f34-8573-3150eaf0ae8b'}, {'abstract': 'These Korean pajeon, vegetable pancakes from the chef Sohui Kim, are just the thing to kick off the week.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/28/dining/you-need-these-pancakes.html', 'snippet': 'These Korean pajeon, vegetable pancakes from the chef Sohui Kim, are just the thing to kick off the week.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Good morning. My meat consumption’s dropping, I’ve noticed. Mostly this is because I’ve been serving less of it. Sometimes I don’t serve it at all, which those who know me well regard with some suspicion, even alarm. I’ve generally been the guy who orders a veal Parm to accompany the steak. I think the proper number of sausages to accompany two eggs over easy is three. I like a little nugget of sizzling lamb fat a lot more than I do, say, a radish.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/30/dining/25apperex1-copy/merlin_163151043_0149dfbb-1ce6-4e5f-8e3e-490370fb1aa2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/30/dining/25apperex1-copy/merlin_163151043_0149dfbb-1ce6-4e5f-8e3e-490370fb1aa2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/30/dining/25apperex1-copy/merlin_163151043_0149dfbb-1ce6-4e5f-8e3e-490370fb1aa2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/30/dining/25apperex1-copy/merlin_163151043_0149dfbb-1ce6-4e5f-8e3e-490370fb1aa2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/30/dining/25apperex1-copy/merlin_163151043_0149dfbb-1ce6-4e5f-8e3e-490370fb1aa2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/10/30/dining/25apperex1-copy/merlin_163151043_0149dfbb-1ce6-4e5f-8e3e-490370fb1aa2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/30/dining/25apperex1-copy/merlin_163151043_0149dfbb-1ce6-4e5f-8e3e-490370fb1aa2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'You Need These Pancakes', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Vegetables', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kim, Sohui', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-10-28T14:30:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sam Sifton', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sifton', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e6bcecb6-41d7-5184-a7be-06809a6fe591', 'word_count': 652, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e6bcecb6-41d7-5184-a7be-06809a6fe591'}, {'abstract': 'The country singer and songwriter on her new album, “Wildcard,” scooping the tabloids and her life as a teenage goody-goody.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/28/arts/music/miranda-lambert-wildcard.html', 'snippet': 'The country singer and songwriter on her new album, “Wildcard,” scooping the tabloids and her life as a teenage goody-goody.', 'lead_paragraph': 'One night not long ago, Miranda Lambert was drinking wine on her porch in Nashville with a friend who’d planned to drive home. Lambert discouraged her from getting behind the wheel: “You’re way too pretty for prison,” she said. The next day, Lambert and three other songwriters turned that phrase into a song.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/03/arts/03Miranda-Lambert-promo/03Miranda-Lambert-promo-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/11/03/arts/03Miranda-Lambert-promo/03Miranda-Lambert-promo-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/03/arts/03Miranda-Lambert-promo/03Miranda-Lambert-promo-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/03/arts/03Miranda-Lambert-promo/03Miranda-Lambert-promo-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/03/arts/03Miranda-Lambert-promo/03Miranda-Lambert-promo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/11/03/arts/03Miranda-Lambert-promo/03Miranda-Lambert-promo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/03/arts/03Miranda-Lambert-promo/03Miranda-Lambert-promo-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Miranda Lambert Doesn’t Mean to Offend. She’s ‘a Little Too Honest.’', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Offended? She’s Just Being Honest', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Country Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lambert, Miranda', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Wildcard (Album)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Pistol Annies (Music Group)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-10-28T14:37:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Arts&Leisure', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rob Tannenbaum', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rob', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Tannenbaum', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/490d549f-d0e0-5ad6-8fc2-ed7447e7bf7c', 'word_count': 1703, 'uri': 'nyt://article/490d549f-d0e0-5ad6-8fc2-ed7447e7bf7c'}, {'abstract': 'Nancy Pelosi announced that the House would take a formal vote on the impeachment investigation later this week.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/28/us/politics/trump-impeachment.html', 'snippet': 'Nancy Pelosi announced that the House would take a formal vote on the impeachment investigation later this week.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Times has obtained a copy of the opening statement that Lt. Col. Alexander Vindman, the top Ukraine expert on the National Security Council, plans to deliver to House impeachment investigators on Tuesday. Here are four highlights:', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/28/us/politics/28dc-impeachbriefing/merlin_163471161_c3af79fe-e557-4f58-a5ed-e40db95085dd-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/28/us/politics/28dc-impeachbriefing/merlin_163471161_c3af79fe-e557-4f58-a5ed-e40db95085dd-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/28/us/politics/28dc-impeachbriefing/merlin_163471161_c3af79fe-e557-4f58-a5ed-e40db95085dd-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/28/us/politics/28dc-impeachbriefing/merlin_163471161_c3af79fe-e557-4f58-a5ed-e40db95085dd-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/28/us/politics/28dc-impeachbriefing/28dc-impeachbriefing-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/10/28/us/politics/28dc-impeachbriefing/28dc-impeachbriefing-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight'