ion-avoidance systems could reduce that toll, but new tests show significant differences in how well they work.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/29/business/pedestrian-deaths-collision-avoidance.html', 'snippet': 'As pedestrian deaths climb, collision-avoidance systems could reduce that toll, but new tests show significant differences in how well they work.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Almost 6,300 pedestrians were killed in 2018 in the United States, the highest number since 1990, federal officials said this month. Collision-avoidance systems on many new vehicles could reduce that toll, but there are significant differences in how well they work, according to new tests.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/29/business/29wheels-safety/29wheels-safety-articleLarge.png', 'height': 381, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/29/business/29wheels-safety/29wheels-safety-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 381}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/29/business/29wheels-safety/29wheels-safety-jumbo.png', 'height': 593, 'width': 934, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/29/business/29wheels-safety/29wheels-safety-superJumbo.png', 'height': 593, 'width': 934, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/29/business/29wheels-safety/29wheels-safety-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/10/29/business/29wheels-safet