00', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/07ef56df-4cdc-5fa3-a134-fa09df47782e', 'word_count': 487, 'uri': 'nyt://article/07ef56df-4cdc-5fa3-a134-fa09df47782e'}, {'abstract': 'Headwear, sweaters and bags in graphic patterns and shapes stand out from the crowds in bustling Ho Chi Minh City.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/29/t-magazine/fall-mens-clothing.html', 'snippet': 'Headwear, sweaters and bags in graphic patterns and shapes stand out from the crowds in bustling Ho Chi Minh City.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Dressing for autumn can feel like an exercise in putting on just enough garments to further prolong breaking out one’s parka. This season, though, layers are anything but modest. Photographed in and around the bustling street markets of Ho Chi Minh City, Vietnam, headwear, sweaters and bags in graphic patterns and shapes stand out from the crowds. Below, a cast of the city’s young motorcyclists model fall’s most vibrant pieces at the Cholon, Cho Ben Thanh and Cho Ba Chieu markets.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/21/t-magazine/21tmag-vietnam-slide-EFRN/21tmag-vietnam-slide-EFRN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 750, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/21/t-magazine/21tmag-vietnam-slide-EFRN/21tmag-vietnam-slide-EFRN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 750}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/21/t-magazine/21tmag-vietnam-slide-EFRN/21tmag-vietnam-slide-EFRN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 820, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/21/t-magazine/21tmag-vietnam-slide-EFRN/21tmag-vietnam-slide-EFRN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1639, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/21/t-magazine/21tmag-vietnam-slide-EFRN/21tmag-vietnam-slide-EFRN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/10/21/t-magazine/21tmag-vietnam-slide-EFRN/21tmag-vietnam-slide-EFRN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/21/t-magazine/21tmag-vietnam-slide-EFRN/21tmag-vietnam-slide-EFRN-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Fall’s Boldest Men’s Wear, Photographed in Vietnam', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Ho Chi Minh City (Vietnam)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Men and Boys', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-10-29T16:56:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/31c4e6d1-7c46-5247-9d3f-0706615a8a18', 'word_count': 101, 'uri': 'nyt://article/31c4e6d1-7c46-5247-9d3f-0706615a8a18'}, {'abstract': 'The new precondition is likely to complicate any revival of the peace negotiations called off last month by President Trump.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/29/world/asia/afghanistan-taliban-talks-ceasefire.html', 'snippet': 'The new precondition is likely to complicate any revival of the peace negotiations called off last month by President Trump.', 'lead_paragraph': 'KABUL, Afghanistan — The Afghan government said on Tuesday that it would not take part in negotiations with Taliban unless a cease-fire had first held for at least a month, a demand that is likely to face resistance from the insurgents and complicate the revival of peace efforts that were upended by President Trump.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/29/world/29afghanistan/merlin_163510221_7b417610-14ef-4045-8f33-c7bcf10c951b-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/29/world/29afghanistan/merlin_163510221_7b417610-14ef-4045-8f33-c7bcf10c951b-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/29/world/29afghanistan/merlin_163510221_7b417610-14ef-4045-8f33-c7bcf10c951b-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/29/world/29afghanistan/merlin_163510221_7b417610-14ef-4045-8f33-c7bcf10c951b-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/29/world/29afghanistan/29afghanistan-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/10/29/world/29afghanistan/29afghanistan-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thum