o as Saigon) feels surprisingly new. The metropolis is constantly reinventing itself,\xa0and when you consider that the U.S. trade embargo was lifted only 25 years ago, and that the majority of the city’s population is under 35 years old, you begin to understand why.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/24/t-magazine/travel/24tmag-vietnam-slide-UQJL/24tmag-vietnam-slide-UQJL-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 324, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/24/t-magazine/travel/24tmag-vietnam-slide-UQJL/24tmag-vietnam-slide-UQJL-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 324}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/24/t-magazine/travel/24tmag-vietnam-slide-UQJL/24tmag-vietnam-slide-UQJL-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 553, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/24/t-magazine/travel/24tmag-vietnam-slide-UQJL/24tmag-vietnam-slide-UQJL-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1107, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/24/t-magazine/travel/24tmag-vietnam-slide-UQJL/24tmag-vietnam-slide-UQJL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/10/24/t-magazine/travel/24tmag-vietnam-slide-UQJL/24tmag-vietnam-slide-UQJL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/24/t-magazine/travel/24tmag-vietnam-slide-UQJL/24tmag-vietnam-slide-UQJL-thumbLarge.jp