ticle/98572b5b-0f96-5ddd-9311-bfeeca33d98b'}, {'abstract': 'Not in the Cold War, not during Vietnam, not during Watergate did I ever fear more for my country.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/29/opinion/trump-zuckerberg.html', 'snippet': 'Not in the Cold War, not during Vietnam, not during Watergate did I ever fear more for my country.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If America’s worst enemies had spent years designing a plan to erode our greatest strengths, they could not have done better than what some of our fellow citizens are doing to the country every day for short-term financial or political gain.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '29', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/31/opinion/29Friedman-2/merlin_163196451_35c16e28-414b-4baa-a329-2398731d4f47-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/31/opinion/29Friedman-2/merlin_163196451_35c16e28-414b-4baa-a329-2398731d4f47-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/31/opinion/29Friedman-2/merlin_163196451_35c16e28-414b-4baa-a329-2398731d4f47-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/31/opinion/29Friedman-2/merlin_163196451_35c16e28-414b-4baa-a329-2398731d4f47-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/31/opinion/29Friedman-2/29Friedman-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'leg