ount': 1755, 'uri': 'nyt://article/10f60eed-4569-5a6e-a7d2-41bbda3008c8'}, {'abstract': 'Among middle-aged men and women who took about 7,000 steps a day, covering even a little extra ground was tied to better sleep.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/30/well/move/how-walking-might-affect-our-sleep.html', 'snippet': 'Among middle-aged men and women who took about 7,000 steps a day, covering even a little extra ground was tied to better sleep.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Taking more steps during the day may be related to better sleep at night, according to an encouraging new study of lifestyle and sleep patterns. The study, which delved into the links between walking and snoozing, suggests that being active can influence how well we sleep, whether we actually exercise or not. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/05/well/physed-walking2/physed-walking2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 353, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/11/05/well/physed-walking2/physed-walking2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 353}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/05/well/physed-walking2/physed-walking2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 602, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/05/well/physed-walking2/physed-walking2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1205, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/05/well/physed-walking2/physed-walking2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_n