31', 'word_count': 1597, 'uri': 'nyt://article/51eb4b37-a0d0-503f-bd50-1e4ac32a1b31'}, {'abstract': 'When Lucas Carvalho was struggling, his aunt helped him get a fresh start. Having overcome anxiety and depression, he is pursuing his dream of becoming a lawyer.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/30/neediest-cases/depression-anxiety-law-school.html', 'snippet': 'When Lucas Carvalho was struggling, his aunt helped him get a fresh start. Having overcome anxiety and depression, he is pursuing his dream of becoming a lawyer.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For Lucas Carvalho, adulthood arrived suddenly.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/22/neediest-cases/00ncf-carvalho/00ncf-carvalho-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 900, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/22/neediest-cases/00ncf-carvalho/00ncf-carvalho-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 900}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/22/neediest-cases/00ncf-carvalho/00ncf-carvalho-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 683, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/22/neediest-cases/00ncf-carvalho/00ncf-carvalho-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1366, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/22/neediest-cases/00ncf-carvalho/00ncf-carvalho-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/10/22/neediest-cases/00ncf-carvalho/00ncf-carvalho-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/22/neediest-cases/00ncf-carvalho/00ncf-carvalho-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '‘Like a Golden Ticket’: A MetroCard Helped Him Get Back on Track', 'kicker': 'The Neediest Cases Fund', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Dreaming of Law School After a ‘Golden Ticket’', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Times Neediest Cases Fund', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Community Service Society of New York', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-10-30T14:11:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'Neediest Cases', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sara Aridi', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sara', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Aridi', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/894c3630-85c1-5507-812e-e30f55a11374', 'word_count': 872, 'uri': 'nyt://article/894c3630-85c1-5507-812e-e30f55a11374'}, {'abstract': 'In a career that spanned more than six decades, he appeared in landmark performances and made classic recordings with Maria Callas and other opera legends.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/30/arts/music/rolando-panerai-dead.html', 'snippet': 'In a career that spanned more than six decades, he appeared in landmark performances and made classic recordings with Maria Callas and other opera legends.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Rolando Panerai, an Italian baritone who sang more than 150 roles at leading international opera houses, made many classic recordings and appeared frequently with the celebrated soprano Maria Callas in her prime, died on Oct. 22 at his home outside Florence, Italy. He was 95.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/04/obituaries/29Panerai2/merlin_163308705_3f018388-e1a0-4e23-80b9-f4cb8e919992-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 563, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/11/04/obituaries/29Panerai2/merlin_163308705_3f018388-e1a0-4e23-80b9-f4cb8e919992-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 563}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/04/obituaries/29Panerai2/merlin_163308705_3f018388-e1a0-4e23-80b9-f4cb8e919992-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 961, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/04/obituaries/29Panerai2/merlin_163308705_3f018388-e1a0-4e23-80b9-f4cb8e919992-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1923, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/04/obituaries/29Panerai2/29Panerai2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/11/04/obituaries/29Panerai2/29Panerai2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/04/obituaries/29Panerai2/29Panerai2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Rolando Panerai, Renowned Baritone and Callas Collaborator, Dies at 95', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Rolando Panerai, 95, Singer With Rich, Prolific Baritone', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Panerai, Rolando', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Opera', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Lucia di Lammermoor (Opera)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-10-30T14:16:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Obits', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Anthony Tommasini', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Anthony', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Tommasini', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/d045e205-7cc9-570b-9172-b21a2806f911', 'word_count': 926, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d045e205-7cc9-570b-9172-b21a2806f911'}, {'abstract': 'Gospel music insiders on the rapper’s turn to religious music and how his album relates to contemporary holy hip-hop.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/30/arts/music/popcast-kanye-west-jesus-is-king.html', 'snippet': 'Gospel music insiders on the rapper’s turn to religious music and how his album relates to contemporary holy hip-hop.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Last week, Kanye West released his ninth album, “Jesus Is King,” and an Imax film of the same name. They were the culmination of several months of dalliances with religious music, consisting largely of weekly performances he calls Sunday Services, with a full gospel choir, near his California home.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/30/arts/30popcast/merlin_163268271_4c94f238-cf8e-46e4-8bf9-0286a47c5785-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 412, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/30/arts/30popcast/merlin_163268271_4c94f238-cf8e-46e4-8bf9-0286a47c5785-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 412}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/30/arts/30popcast/merlin_163268271_4c94f238-cf8e-46e4-8bf9-0286a47c5785-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 703, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/30/arts/30popcast/merlin_163268271_4c94f238-cf8e-46e4-8bf9-0286a47c5785-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1407, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/30/arts/30popcast/30popcast-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/10/30/arts/30popcast/30popcast-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/30/arts/30popcast/30popcast-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Kanye West’s ‘Jesus Is King,’ From the Gospel Perspective', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gospel Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Rap and Hip-Hop', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'West, Kanye', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Jesus Is King (Album)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Religion and Belief', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-10-30T14:21:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4543a1da-39aa-527d-8d7c-ce9d337e7dae', 'word_count': 199, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4543a1da-39aa-527d-8d7c-ce9d337e7dae'}, {'abstract': 'Use mayonnaise, as he does, to make mighty marinades for chicken and steaks, or to encourage browning on fish or grilled cheeses.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/30/dining/j-kenji-lopez-alts-secret-ingredient.html', 'snippet': 'Use mayonnaise, as he does, to make mighty marinades for chicken and steaks, or to encourage browning on fish or grilled cheeses.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Good morning. J. Kenji López-Alt is back in our pages this week with a smart look at his favorite secret ingredient: mayonnaise. You can smear it on fish to encourage browning in the pan; you have to try it on the exterior of a grilled cheese sandwich, for similar reasons. Kenji uses mayonnaise on steaks cooked sous-vide, so that when he sautés them in a pan they develop the most marvelous crusts. And he cuts mayonnaise with all sorts of concoctions to make mighty marinades — with teriyaki sauce, curry paste, pesto, barbecue sauce. Try his mayo-marinated chicken with chimichurri (above) for dinner tonight, and you may find yourself a convert.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/30/dining/28Kenjirex1-copy/28Kenjirex1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 403, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/30/dining/28Kenjirex1-copy/28Kenjirex1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 403}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/30/dining/28Kenjirex1-copy/28Kenjirex1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 688, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/30/dining/28Kenjirex1-copy/28Kenjirex1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1375, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/30/dining/28Kenjirex1-copy/28Kenjirex1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/10/30/dining/28Kenjirex1-copy/28Kenjirex1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/30/dining/28Kenjirex1-copy/28Kenjirex1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'J. Kenji López-Alt’s Secret Ingredient', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-10-30T14:30:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sam Sifton', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sifton', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e8e50b72-4c20-57d4-96d1-4fbdadb2f25a', 'word_count': 732, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e8e50b72-4c20-57d4-96d1-4fbdadb2f25a'}, {'abstract': 'Rodney Patterson reworks classic Western hats into avant-garde creations for his own line, Esenshel, and for entertainers including Billy Porter and Lizzo.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/30/t-magazine/rodney-patterson-esenshel.html', 'snippet': 'Rodney Patterson reworks classic Western hats into avant-garde creations for his own line, Esenshel, and for entertainers including Billy Porter and Lizzo.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Growing up in mid-South Side Chicago in the late 1970s and early ’80s, Rodney Patterson often dreamed of making avant-garde clothing like the fashion designers Rei Kawakubo and Jean-Paul Gaultier. While a career creating high-end clothes might have been seen as a long shot at that time for a black man from the Midwest, Patterson expressed his love of fashion through his own personal style — especially his hats. After moving to New York in the late ’80s — where he worked as a visual merchandiser by day and designed Judy Jetson-like dresses for his own independent women’s wear label at night — he would punctuate his outfits with exuberant headwear: the exaggerated Philip Treacy fedora popularized by Boy George, with its slanted brim and angular crown, or Vivienne Westwood’s dramatically oversize Buffalo hat.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/03/t-magazine/29tmag-patterson-slide-OPE0/29tmag-patterson-slide-OPE0-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 900, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/11/03/t-magazine/29tmag-patterson-slide-OPE0/29tmag-patterson-slide-OPE0-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 900}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/03/t-magazine/29tmag-patterson-slide-OPE0/29tmag-patterson-slide-OPE0-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 683, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/03/t-magazine/29tmag-patterson-slide-OPE0/29tmag-patterson-slide-OPE0-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'wi