ppear voluntarily.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/30/us/politics/trump-impeachment-inquiry-updates.html', 'snippet': 'House Democrats requested interviews with three major witnesses, including John Bolton, who said he would not appear voluntarily.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On Thursday, the House will take a vote to set out rules and procedures for the impeachment inquiry. The Democrats produced the resolution after weeks of complaints by Republicans about the lack of such a vote. Here’s what will look new about the investigation:', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/30/us/politics/30dc-impeachbriefing2-promo/30dc-impeachbriefing2-promo-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/30/us/politics/30dc-impeachbriefing2-promo/30dc-impeachbriefing2-promo-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/30/us/politics/30dc-impeachbriefing2-promo/30dc-impeachbriefing2-promo-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/30/us/politics/30dc-impeachbriefing2-promo/30dc-impeachbriefing2-promo-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/30/us/politics/30dc-impeachbriefing2-promo/30dc-impeachbriefing2-promo-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/10/30/us/politics/30dc-impeachbriefing2-promo/30dc-impea