 a sensation? What’s with the plot? Based on what we know of the show, here’s our guide to this unlikely mash-up of C.G.I. and T.S. Eliot.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/30/movies/cats-movie-musical.html', 'snippet': 'Why was the musical a sensation? What’s with the plot? Based on what we know of the show, here’s our guide to this unlikely mash-up of C.G.I. and T.S. Eliot.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Now and Forever,” the old Winter Garden Theater posters used to read. Loosely translated, that means you’ve had the equivalent of forever to see “Cats” in one incarnation or another. But maybe, despite everything, you never got around to it, or maybe you saw it so long ago that you no longer recall what all the fuss was about.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '36', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/03/arts/03cats-preview2/03cats-preview2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 247, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/11/03/arts/03cats-preview2/03cats-preview2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 247}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/03/arts/03cats-preview2/03cats-preview2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 422, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/03/arts/03cats-preview2/03cats-preview2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 843, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/03/arts/03cats-preview2/03cats-preview2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': '