.nytimes.com/2019/10/30/us/politics/trump-ukraine-senate.html', 'snippet': 'John Sullivan, the deputy secretary of state, told lawmakers he believed the president’s personal lawyer was involved in the plot to remove the ambassador to Ukraine.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — John Sullivan, the deputy secretary of state, said on Wednesday that President Trump’s personal lawyer Rudolph W. Giuliani was involved in a smear campaign to oust the ambassador to Ukraine, publicly confirming a key part of the saga behind the impeachment inquiry.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/30/us/politics/30dc-diplo-1/merlin_163572741_dfb05fe5-bd44-4147-b8c2-eb7b6bed6c62-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/30/us/politics/30dc-diplo-1/merlin_163572741_dfb05fe5-bd44-4147-b8c2-eb7b6bed6c62-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/30/us/politics/30dc-diplo-1/merlin_163572741_dfb05fe5-bd44-4147-b8c2-eb7b6bed6c62-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/30/us/politics/30dc-diplo-1/merlin_163572741_dfb05fe5-bd44-4147-b8c2-eb7b6bed6c62-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/30/us/politics/30dc-diplo-1/merlin_163572741_dfb05fe5-bd44-4147-b8c2-eb7b6bed6c62-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'th