cy Pelosi’s close hold over her caucus.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/30/us/politics/democrats-impeachment-vote.html', 'snippet': 'Members who have long resisted a formal floor vote are now solidly behind the idea. The change reflects Speaker Nancy Pelosi’s close hold over her caucus.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — When Speaker Nancy Pelosi polled Democrats privately about taking a formal floor vote on the impeachment inquiry into President Trump earlier this month, the idea was scuttled by nervous moderates who feared a backlash from voters in their Trump-friendly districts.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/30/us/politics/30dc-democrats1/merlin_163567671_38321c44-16ba-415c-85fa-26d9b67ab0bf-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/30/us/politics/30dc-democrats1/merlin_163567671_38321c44-16ba-415c-85fa-26d9b67ab0bf-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/30/us/politics/30dc-democrats1/merlin_163567671_38321c44-16ba-415c-85fa-26d9b67ab0bf-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/30/us/politics/30dc-democrats1/merlin_163567671_38321c44-16ba-415c-85fa-26d9b67ab0bf-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/30/us/politics/30dc-democrats1/30dc-democrats1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_na