us versions, working out everything from fabric colors to armhole placement. “This is actually No. 122,” Sastrawinata-Lemay said. “There are 121 iterations of it that you’ll never see.”', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/03/arts/03FROZEN-COSTUMES15/merlin_162711693_a0bbe44c-8682-4dd0-8d7c-f43eb7ec8a56-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 251, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/11/03/arts/03FROZEN-COSTUMES15/merlin_162711693_a0bbe44c-8682-4dd0-8d7c-f43eb7ec8a56-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 251}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/03/arts/03FROZEN-COSTUMES15/merlin_162711693_a0bbe44c-8682-4dd0-8d7c-f43eb7ec8a56-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 429, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/03/arts/03FROZEN-COSTUMES15/merlin_162711693_a0bbe44c-8682-4dd0-8d7c-f43eb7ec8a56-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 804, 'width': 1920, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/03/arts/03FROZEN-COSTUMES15/03FROZEN-COSTUMES15-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/11/03/arts/03FROZEN-COSTUMES15/03FROZEN-COSTUMES15-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/03/arts/03FROZEN-COSTUMES15/03FROZEN-COSTUMES15-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLa