f6e7f69-0875-5182-9a20-ef605d382d1a'}, {'abstract': 'Enormous antigovernment demonstrations in Iraq and Lebanon, some tinged with hostility toward Iran, have suddenly put Iran’s interests at risk.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/10/31/world/middleeast/protests-iraq-lebanon-iran.html', 'snippet': 'Enormous antigovernment demonstrations in Iraq and Lebanon, some tinged with hostility toward Iran, have suddenly put Iran’s interests at risk.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Iran’s hierarchy often rails against the United States, Israel and Saudi Arabia as direct threats to its security and regional influence. But lately the authorities in Tehran have turned their attention to two new sources of worry: Lebanon and Iraq.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/31/world/31iran/merlin_163526076_6cf3c635-2691-41ea-b6c7-2f751b3d13b8-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 407, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/31/world/31iran/merlin_163526076_6cf3c635-2691-41ea-b6c7-2f751b3d13b8-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 407}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/31/world/31iran/merlin_163526076_6cf3c635-2691-41ea-b6c7-2f751b3d13b8-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 694, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/31/world/31iran/merlin_163526076_6cf3c635-2691-41ea-b6c7-2f751b3d13b8-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1389, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/31/world/31iran/31iran-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width'